を使用して","ko":"Android 앱 중지 설정 가이드 - adb shell am force-stop 활용","es":"Guía de configuración de android-stop-app para desarrolla...","fr":"Meilleures pratiques pour arrêter les applications Androi...","de":"Einrichtungsanleitung für android-stop-app: Beenden von A...","pt":"Guia de Configuração do android-stop-app: Parar Aplicativ...","ru":"Настройка ИИ Агента android-stop-app: Остановка Приложени...","ar":"دليل إيقاف تطبيق اندرويد: إيقاف تطبيقات الأندرويد"},"description":{"en":"Learn how to use android-stop-app to terminate Android apps cleanly, preserving data and clearing memory. Get started with our setup guide and optimize your ...","zh":"学习如何使用 Android 停止应用技能停止 Android 应用，包括使用 adb shell am force-stop 命令","ja":"Android アプリを停止する方法を学び、AIエージェントと adb shell am force-stop コマンドを使用してアプリをクリーンに終了させます","ko":"Android 앱을 중지하는 방법을 알아보고 adb shell am force-stop 명령을 사용하여 앱 프로세스를 정리합니다","es":"Aprenda a utilizar android-stop-app para detener aplicaciones Android de manera efectiva y segura","fr":"Découvrez comment utiliser android-stop-app pour arrêter les applications Android proprement","de":"Erfahren Sie, wie Sie android-stop-app verwenden, um Android-Apps sauber zu beenden","pt":"Aprenda a parar aplicativos Android com o android-stop-app, uma ferramenta que usa o comando adb shell am force-stop para terminar processos de aplicativos","ru":"Узнайте, как остановить приложения Android с помощью ИИ Агента android-stop-app, который использует команду adb shell am force-stop для завершения процессов ...","ar":"تعرف على كيفية إيقاف تطبيقات الأندرويد باستخدام إيقاف تطبيق اندرويد، الذي يستخدم أمر adb shell am force-stop لإيقاف عمليات التطبيقات"},"definition":{"en":"android-stop-app is a skill that stops Android apps running on connected devices using the `adb shell am force-stop` command, providing a clean termination of app processes.","zh":"Android 停止应用技能是一种使用 adb shell am force-stop 命令停止 Android 应用的技术","ja":"Android アプリ停止スキルは、Android アプリを停止するために使用される AIエージェントの 1 つです","ko":"Android 앱 중지 스킬은 Android 앱을 중지하는 데 사용되는 기술 중 하나입니다","es":"android-stop-app es una habilidad que detiene las aplicaciones Android en un dispositivo conectado","fr":"android-stop-app est une fonctionnalité qui arrête les applications Android sur un appareil connecté","de":"android-stop-app ist eine Fähigkeit, die Android-Apps auf einem verbundenen Gerät beendet","pt":"O android-stop-app é uma ferramenta que para aplicativos Android","ru":"ИИ Агент android-stop-app - это инструмент для остановки приложений Android","ar":"إيقاف تطبيق اندرويد هو أداة لإيقاف تطبيقات الأندرويد"},"features":{"en":["Terminates Android apps using `adb shell am force-stop` command","Preserves app data while clearing memory","Supports clean termination of app processes","Invoked by user requests to stop or kill the Android app","Useful for stopping apps before deploying new versions"],"zh":["使用 adb shell am force-stop 命令停止 Android 应用","清除内存同时保留应用数据","支持 Android 设备连接","可用于停止应用之前部署新版本"],"ja":["adb shell am force-stop コマンドを使用して Android アプリを停止","メモリをクリーンにし、同時にアプリデータを保持","Android デバイス接続をサポート","新しいバージョンのデプロイ前にアプリを停止するために使用可能"],"ko":["adb shell am force-stop 명령을 사용하여 Android 앱을 중지","메모리를 정리同时 앱 데이터를 보존","Android 디바이스 연결 지원","새 버전을 배포하기 전에 앱을 중지하는 데 사용 가능"],"es":["Utiliza adb shell am force-stop para detener aplicaciones","Preserva los datos de la aplicación","Limpia la memoria al terminar los procesos de la aplicación","Se utiliza antes de implementar una nueva versión de la aplicación","Soporta dispositivos Android conectados"],"fr":["Utilise adb shell am force-stop pour arrêter les applications","Préserve les données de l''application","Nettoie la mémoire en terminant les processus de l''application","Est utilisé avant de déployer une nouvelle version de l''application","Prend en charge les appareils Android connectés"],"de":["Verwendet adb shell am force-stop, um Apps zu beenden","Bewahrt die App-Daten","Bereinigt den Speicher, indem die App-Prozesse beendet werden","Wird verwendet, bevor eine neue Version der App bereitgestellt wird","Unterstützt verbundene Android-Geräte"],"pt":["Usa o comando adb shell am force-stop para parar aplicativos","Termina processos de aplicativos de forma limpa","Preserva dados de aplicativos","Compatível com dispositivos Android conectados","Útil para depurar e testar aplicativos"],"ru":["Использует команду adb shell am force-stop для остановки приложений","Чисто завершает процессы приложений","Сохраняет данные приложений","Поддерживает подключенные устройства Android","Полезен для отладки и тестирования приложений"],"ar":["يستخدم أمر adb shell am force-stop لإيقاف التطبيقات","يوقف عمليات التطبيقات بطريقة نظيفة","يحافظ على بيانات التطبيقات","متوافق مع أجهزة الأندرويد المتصلة","مفيد لتصحيح الأخطاء واختبار التطبيقات"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use android-stop-app","android-stop-app setup guide","what is android-stop-app","android-stop-app alternative","android-stop-app vs force-stop","android-stop-app install","terminating android apps with adb","clean app termination","preserving app data"],"zh":["Android 停止应用","adb shell am force-stop","Android 应用停止指南","AI 应用停止工具","Android 应用开发","Android 应用测试"],"ja":["Android アプリ停止","adb shell am force-stop","Android アプリ停止ベストプラクティス","AIエージェント","Android アプリ開発","Android アプリテスト"],"ko":["Android 앱 중지","adb shell am force-stop","Android 앱 중지 설정 가이드","AI 앱 중지 도구","Android 앱 개발","Android 앱 테스트"],"es":["android-stop-app","detener aplicaciones Android","adb shell am force-stop","preservar datos de aplicación","limpiar memoria","implementar nueva versión de aplicación","Herramientas de desarrollo de Android","Agentes de IA para desarrolladores"],"fr":["android-stop-app","arrêter les applications Android","adb shell am force-stop","préserver les données de l''application","nettoyer la mémoire","déployer une nouvelle version de l''application","Outils de développement Android","Agents IA pour les développeurs"],"de":["android-stop-app","Android-Apps beenden","adb shell am force-stop","App-Daten bewahren","Speicher bereinigen","neue Version der App bereitstellen","Android-Entwicklungstools","KI-Agents für Entwickler"],"pt":["android-stop-app","parar aplicativos android","adb shell am force-stop","ferramentas de desenvolvimento android","depurar aplicativos android","testar aplicativos android","índice de desenvolvedores android"],"ru":["android-stop-app","остановка приложений android","ИИ Агенты для android","команда adb shell am force-stop","инструменты разработки android","отладка приложений android","тестирование приложений android","справочник разработчиков android"],"ar":["إيقاف تطبيق اندرويد","توقف تطبيقات الأندرويد","أدوات إيقاف الأندرويد","أمر adb shell am force-stop","أدوات تطوير الأندرويد","تصحيح أخطاء تطبيقات الأندرويد","اختبار تطبيقات الأندرويد","دليل مطورين الأندرويد"]}},"owner":"asnar00","repo":"miso","repoPath":"asnar00/miso","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.302Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"android-stop-app","description":"Stop the Android app running on connected device. Cleanly terminates the app using force-stop. Use when stopping the app for debugging, testing, or cleanup.","bodyPreview":"# Android Stop App\n\n## Overview\n\nStops the Android app running on a connected device by using `adb shell am force-stop`. This cleanly terminates all app processes, clearing memory while preserving app data.\n\n## When to Use\n\nInvoke this skill when the user:\n- Asks to \"stop the Android app\"\n- Wants to \"kill the app\"\n- Says \"terminate the Android app on device\"\n- Mentions shutting down or closing the Android app\n- Needs to stop before deploying new version\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Android device connec","body":"# Android Stop App\n\n## Overview\n\nStops the Android app running on a connected device by using `adb shell am force-stop`. This cleanly terminates all app processes, clearing memory while preserving app data.\n\n## When to Use\n\nInvoke this skill when the user:\n- Asks to \"stop the Android app\"\n- Wants to \"kill the app\"\n- Says \"terminate the Android app on device\"\n- Mentions shutting down or closing the Android app\n- Needs to stop before deploying new version\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Android device connected via USB\n- USB debugging enabled\n- ADB installed (`brew install android-platform-tools`)\n- Device authorized\n- App must be running on the device\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. Navigate to the Android app directory:\n   ```bash\n   cd path/to/android/app\n   ```\n\n2. Run the stop script:\n   ```bash\n   ./stop-app.sh\n   ```\n\n3. The script will:\n   - Use `adb shell am force-stop` to terminate the app\n   - Report success\n\n4. Inform the user:\n   - The app has been stopped\n   - Safe to call even if app isn''t running\n   - Uses force-stop for clean shutdown (not kill)\n\n## Expected Output\n\n```\n🛑 Stopping NoobTest on device...\n✅ App stopped\n```\n\n## How It Works\n\nThe script uses:\n- `adb shell am force-stop com.miso.noobtest`\n\nThis Android framework command:\n- Stops all processes associated with the package\n- Clears app from memory\n- Preserves app data and settings\n- Clean shutdown (not emergency kill)\n\n## force-stop vs kill\n\n**force-stop** (recommended):\n- Android framework command\n- Clean shutdown\n- Preserves app data\n- Safe for development\n\n**kill** (not recommended):\n- OS-level signal\n- Abrupt termination\n- May leave resources in inconsistent state\n- Only use if force-stop fails\n\n## Common Use Cases\n\n**Before deploying new version**:\n```bash\n./stop-app.sh\n./install-device.sh\n```\n\n**Pairing with restart**:\n```bash\n./stop-app.sh\n# Make configuration changes\n./restart-app.sh\n```\n\n**Clean state testing**:\n```bash\n./stop-app.sh\n# Clear app data manually if needed\nadb shell pm clear com.miso.noobtest\n# Then install fresh\n```\n\n## Common Issues\n\n**\"no devices found\"**:\n- Check USB connection\n- Ensure USB debugging enabled\n- Verify authorized: `adb devices`\n- Try: `adb kill-server && adb start-server`\n\n**\"adb: command not found\"**:\n- Install Android platform tools: `brew install android-platform-tools`\n- Check PATH includes adb\n\n**App still running after force-stop**:\n- Rare, but check with: `adb shell pidof com.miso.noobtest`\n- If still running, restart device\n- Or use: `adb shell pm clear com.miso.noobtest` (nukes app data too)\n\n## Safety\n\nThis script is safe to call repeatedly:\n- Won''t error if app isn''t running\n- Uses clean shutdown method\n- Reports status clearly\n- No risk to app data or installation\n\n## Package Name\n\nThe script is configured for the specific app''s package name (e.g., `com.miso.noobtest` for Firefly/NoobTest). Package name is defined in build.gradle.kts under `applicationId`.\n\n## Data Preservation\n\n`force-stop` does NOT clear:\n- App installation\n- App data (SharedPreferences, databases, files)\n- App permissions\n- User settings\n\nTo fully clear app state, use:\n```bash\nadb shell pm clear com.miso.noobtest\n```\n\nBut this will require reinstallation and setup.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:01:43.060Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Mobile Automation Agents requiring efficient Android app management capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要高效的Android应用管理能力的移动自动化代理。","ja":"Androidアプリの管理能力を効率的に必要とするモバイル自動化エージェントに最適です。","ko":"효율적인 안드로이드 앱 관리 기능을 필요로 하는 모바일 자동화 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Automatización Móvil que requieren capacidades de gestión de aplicaciones de Android eficientes.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents d''Automatisation Mobile nécessitant des capacités de gestion d''applications Android efficaces.","de":"Ideal für Mobile Automation Agents, die effiziente Android-App-Management-Funktionen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de automação móvel que exigem capacidades de gerenciamento de aplicativos Android eficientes.","ru":"Идеально для мобильных агентов автоматизации, требующих эффективных возможностей управления приложениями Android.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الآليين المحمول الذين يتطلبون إمكانيات إدارة تطبيقات Android فعالة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to terminate Android apps using `adb shell am force-stop`, preserving app data while clearing memory, and supporting deployment of new app versions via protocols like ADB.","zh":"赋予代理终止Android应用的能力，使用`adb shell am force-stop`，在清除内存的同时保留应用数据，并支持通过ADB等协议部署新的应用版本。","ja":"エージェントにAndroidアプリを終了させる能力を付与します。`adb shell am force-stop`を使用して、アプリデータを保持しながらメモリをクリアし、ADBなどのプロトコルを介して新しいアプリバージョンのデプロイをサポートします。","ko":"에이전트에게 안드로이드 애플리케이션을 종료시키는 능력을 부여합니다. `adb shell am force-stop`를 사용하여, 애플리케이션 데이터를 유지하는 동시에 메모리를.clear하고, ADB와 같은 프로토콜을 통해 새로운 애플리케이션 버전의 배포를 지원합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes terminar aplicaciones de Android usando `adb shell am force-stop`, preservando los datos de la aplicación mientras se limpia la memoria, y apoyando la implementación de nuevas versiones de aplicaciones a través de protocolos como ADB.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''arrêter les applications Android en utilisant `adb shell am force-stop`, en préservant les données de l''application tout en effaçant la mémoire, et en soutenant le déploiement de nouvelles versions d''applications via des protocoles comme ADB.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Android-Apps mit `adb shell am force-stop` zu beenden, wodurch die App-Daten erhalten bleiben, während der Speicher gelöscht wird, und die Bereitstellung neuer App-Versionen über Protokolle wie ADB unterstützt.","pt":"Permite que os agentes encerrem aplicativos Android usando `adb shell am force-stop`, preservando os dados do aplicativo enquanto limpa a memória, e suporta a implantação de novas versões de aplicativos via protocolos como ADB.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью завершать приложения Android с помощью `adb shell am force-stop`, сохраняя при этом данные приложения и очищая память, а также поддерживает развертывание новых версий приложений через протоколы like ADB.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إيقاف تشغيل تطبيقات Android باستخدام `adb shell am force-stop` ، مع الحفاظ على بيانات التطبيق أثناء مسح الذاكرة ، ودعم نشر إصدارات جديدة من التطبيقات عبر بروتوكولات مثل ADB."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating app termination for testing","Stopping apps before deploying new versions","Debugging memory leaks in Android apps"],"zh":["自动化测试中的应用终止","部署新版本前停止应用","调试安卓应用中的内存泄漏"],"ja":["テストのためのアプリ終了の自動化","新しいバージョンのデプロイ前にアプリを停止する","Androidアプリのメモリーリークのデバッグ"],"ko":["테스트를 위한 애플리케이션 종료 자동화","새 버전 배포 전 애플리케이션을 중지시키기","안드로이드 애플리케이션의 메모리 누수 디버깅"],"es":["Automatización de la terminación de aplicaciones para pruebas","Detención de aplicaciones antes de implementar nuevas versiones","Depuración de fugas de memoria en aplicaciones de Android"],"fr":["Automatisation de l''arrêt des applications pour les tests","Arrêt des applications avant de déployer de nouvelles versions","Débogage des fuites de mémoire dans les applications Android"],"de":["Automatisierung des Abbruchs von Apps für Tests","Beenden von Apps vor der Bereitstellung neuer Versionen","Fehlersuche bei Speicherlecks in Android-Apps"],"pt":["Automatizar a terminação de aplicativos para testes","Parar aplicativos antes de implantar novas versões","Depurar vazamentos de memória em aplicativos Android"],"ru":["Автоматизировать завершение приложений для тестирования","Остановить приложения перед развертыванием новых версий","Отладить утечки памяти в приложениях Android"],"ar":["أتمتة إيقاف تشغيل التطبيقات للاختبار","إيقاف تشغيل التطبيقات قبل نشر الإصدارات الجديدة","تصحيح أخطاء تسرب الذاكرة في تطبيقات Android"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires connected Android device","ADB access necessary"],"zh":["需要连接的安卓设备","需要ADB访问"],"ja":["接続されたAndroidデバイスが必要","ADBアクセスが必要"],"ko":["연결된 안드로이드 디바이스가 필요","ADB 접근이 필요"],"es":["Requiere un dispositivo Android conectado","Acceso ADB necesario"],"fr":["Nécessite un appareil Android connecté","Accès ADB nécessaire"],"de":["Benötigt ein verbundenes Android-Gerät","ADB-Zugriff erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer dispositivo Android conectado","Acesso ADB necessário"],"ru":["Требуется подключенное устройство Android","Необходим доступ ADB"],"ar":["يتطلب جهاز Android متصل","مطلوب الوصول إلى ADB"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"ea93e1e3c633a41040ad201ffe50f443575839e2474826a6d83d9e3a1dab19bb","qualityScore":57}');
