典语","ja":"Sport WizardTranslatorは、Sport Wizardアプリケーションのテキストを自然なスウェーデン語に翻訳するAIエージェントです","ko":"Sport WizardTranslator는 Sport Wizard 애플리케이션 텍스트를 자연스러운 스웨덴어로 번역하는 AI 에이전트입니다","es":"sport-wizard-translator es un agente de inteligencia artificial que traduce texto de aplicaciones de fútbol al sueco de manera natural","fr":"sport-wizard-translator est un agent d''intelligence artificielle qui traduit le texte d''applications de football en suédois de manière naturelle","de":"sport-wizard-translator ist ein künstlicher Intelligenzagent, der Fußballanwendungstexte ins Schwedische natürlich übersetzt","pt":"O sport-wizard-translator é um agente de tradução que utiliza análise de contexto profunda para traduzir textos de futebol","ru":"ИИ Агент sport-wizard-translator - это агент перевода, использующий глубокий контекстный анализ для перевода футбольных терминов","ar":"sport-wizard-translator هو عامل ترجمة يستخدم تحليل السياق العميق لترجمة نصوص كرة القدم"},"features":{"en":["Performs deep context analysis to understand component context before translation","Utilizes domain-appropriate Swedish soccer terminology for accurate translations","Prioritizes natural Swedish phrasing over literal translations","Maintains consistency with existing translation patterns in the codebase"],"zh":["深度上下文分析","领域特定术语","自然的瑞典语词序","一致的翻译模式"],"ja":["深いコンテキスト分析","ドメイン適切な用語","自然なスウェーデン語の語順","一貫した翻訳パターン"],"ko":["깊은 문맥 분석","도메인 적합 용어","자연스러운 스웨덴어 단어 순서","일관된 번역 패턴"],"es":["Análisis de contexto profundo para una traducción más precisa","Terminología de fútbol adecuada para un lenguaje más natural","Frases en sueco con un orden de palabras natural","Coherencia en la traducción siguiendo patrones existentes en el código"],"fr":["Analyse de contexte approfondie pour une traduction plus précise","Terminologie de football appropriée pour un langage plus naturel","Phrases en suédois avec un ordre de mots naturel","Cohérence dans la traduction en suivant les modèles existants dans le code"],"de":["Tiefe Kontextanalyse für eine präzisere Übersetzung","Fußballterminologie für einen natürlicheren Sprachstil","Schwedische Sätze mit natürlicher Wortreihenfolge","Konsistenz in der Übersetzung durch Befolgen bestehender Muster im Code"],"pt":["Análise de contexto profunda para traduzir textos de futebol","Uso de terminologia de futebol apropriada","Priorização da ordem natural das palavras em sueco","Consistência com os padrões de tradução existentes no código"],"ru":["Глубокий контекстный анализ для перевода футбольных терминов","Использование подходящей футбольной терминологии","Приоритет естественного порядка слов на шведском языке","Соответствие существующим шаблонам перевода в коде"],"ar":["تحليل السياق العميق لترجمة نصوص كرة القدم","استخدام المصطلحات الكروية المناسبة","الاعتماد على الترتيب الطبيعي للكلمات باللغة السويدية","التوافق مع الأنماط الحالية للترجمة في الكود"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use sport-wizard-translator","sport-wizard-translator alternative","sport-wizard-translator setup guide","what is sport-wizard-translator","sport-wizard-translator vs Google Translate","sport-wizard-translator install for soccer coaching apps"],"zh":["AI工具","Sport WizardTranslator","深度上下文分析","领域特定术语","自然语言处理","机器翻译"],"ja":["AIエージェント","Sport WizardTranslator","深いコンテキスト分析","ドメイン適切な用語","自然言語処理","機械翻訳"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","Sport WizardTranslator","깊은 문맥 분석","도메인 적합 용어","자연어 처리","기계 번역"],"es":["sport-wizard-translator","herramientas de inteligencia artificial para fútbol","traducción de texto de aplicaciones","análisis de contexto profundo","terminología de fútbol","desarrollo de aplicaciones de fútbol","_agentes de inteligencia artificial para deportes","traducción natural de texto"],"fr":["sport-wizard-translator","outils d''intelligence artificielle pour le football","traduction de texte d''applications","analyse de contexte approfondie","terminologie de football","développement d''applications de football","agents d''intelligence artificielle pour les sports","traduction naturelle de texte"],"de":["sport-wizard-translator","künstliche Intelligenztools für Fußball","Textübersetzung von Anwendungen","tiefe Kontextanalyse","Fußballterminologie","Entwicklung von Fußballanwendungen","künstliche Intelligenzagenten für Sport","natürliche Textübersetzung"],"pt":["sport-wizard-translator","tradução de textos de futebol","análise de contexto profunda","terminologia de futebol","ordem natural das palavras em sueco","consistência de tradução","ferramentas de tradução de futebol","tecnologias de tradução automática"],"ru":["ИИ Агент sport-wizard-translator","перевод футбольных терминов","глубокий контекстный анализ","футбольная терминология","естественный порядок слов на шведском языке","соответствие перевода","инструменты перевода футбольных терминов","технологии автоматического перевода"],"ar":["sport-wizard-translator","ترجمة نصوص كرة القدم","تحليل السياق العميق","المصطلحات الكروية","الترتيب الطبيعي للكلمات باللغة السويدية","التوافق في الترجمة","أدوات ترجمة كرة القدم","تكنولوجيا الترجمة الآلية"]}},"owner":"beggan78","repo":"f2016-6-dif","repoPath":"beggan78/f2016-6-dif","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.304Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"sport-wizard-translator","description":"Context-aware Swedish translation for Sport Wizard youth soccer coaching application. Use when the user explicitly requests translation of components, screens, features, or user-facing text to Swedish (e.g., Translate ConfigurationScreen to Swedish, Add Swedish translations for the game screen, Translate the new player rotation UI). This skill provides domain-specific soccer terminology, natural Swedish phrasing patterns, and automated translation workflow that updates both JSON translation files and component code.","bodyPreview":"# Sport Wizard Swedish Translator\n\nTranslate Sport Wizard application text to natural, context-aware Swedish with proper soccer terminology.\n\n## Core Principles\n\n1. **Deep context analysis** - Read and understand the component before translating\n2. **Domain-appropriate terminology** - Use Swedish soccer terms, not literal translations\n3. **Natural phrasing** - Prioritize natural Swedish word order over literal translation\n4. **Consistency** - Follow existing translation patterns in the codebase","body":"# Sport Wizard Swedish Translator\n\nTranslate Sport Wizard application text to natural, context-aware Swedish with proper soccer terminology.\n\n## Core Principles\n\n1. **Deep context analysis** - Read and understand the component before translating\n2. **Domain-appropriate terminology** - Use Swedish soccer terms, not literal translations\n3. **Natural phrasing** - Prioritize natural Swedish word order over literal translation\n4. **Consistency** - Follow existing translation patterns in the codebase\n5. **Preserve names** - Never translate app name, player names, or team names\n\n## Translation Workflow\n\nWhen the user requests translation (e.g., \"Translate GameScreen to Swedish\"):\n\n### Step 1: Analyze the Component\n\nRead the target component file to understand:\n- **Purpose**: What does this component do?\n- **User flow**: How does the user interact with it?\n- **Context**: Where does it appear in the app?\n- **Relationships**: What other components/features does it connect to?\n- **Existing translations**: Are any parts already translated?\n\n**Critical**: Do not just extract strings. Understand the domain context to choose appropriate terminology.\n\n### Step 2: Identify Translatable Text\n\nFind all user-facing text:\n- UI labels and headers\n- Button text\n- Placeholder text\n- Error/warning messages\n- Success messages\n- Helper text and tooltips\n- Modal content\n- Dropdown options\n\n**Exclude**:\n- Variable names and code identifiers\n- Comments (unless they become user-facing)\n- App name \"Sport Wizard\"\n- Player names\n- Team names\n- Log messages (unless user-visible)\n\n### Step 3: Determine Translation Strategy\n\nBefore translating, consult these references:\n\n1. **Soccer terminology** - Read `references/soccer-terminology.md`\n   - Check if text contains soccer-specific terms (defender, midfielder, formation, etc.)\n   - Use domain-appropriate Swedish terms (e.g., \"Back\" not \"Försvarare\")\n\n2. **Natural phrasing** - Read `references/translation-patterns.md`\n   - Check for common UI patterns (buttons, labels, errors)\n   - Apply natural Swedish word order and compound rules\n\n3. **Existing translations** - Read `references/existing-translations.md`\n   - Check if similar text is already translated\n   - Maintain consistent terminology across the app\n\n### Step 4: Create Translation Keys\n\nOrganize translations by namespace:\n\n**Namespace selection:**\n- Use `common` for generic/shared UI (buttons like \"Save\", \"Cancel\", \"Delete\")\n- Use component-specific namespace for component-unique text (e.g., `configuration`, `game`, `profile`)\n- Create new namespace if needed (e.g., `game.json`, `profile.json`)\n\n**Key structure:**\n- Use nested keys for logical grouping: `\"header.title\"`, `\"buttons.save\"`, `\"errors.validation\"`\n- Use descriptive names: `\"squad.selectTitle\"` not `\"label1\"`\n- Group related items: `\"goalies.header\"`, `\"goalies.periodLabel\"`, `\"goalies.placeholder\"`\n\n**Example structure:**\n```json\n{\n  \"header\": {\n    \"title\": \"Screen Title\"\n  },\n  \"buttons\": {\n    \"primary\": \"Primary Action\",\n    \"secondary\": \"Secondary Action\"\n  },\n  \"messages\": {\n    \"success\": \"Success message\",\n    \"error\": \"Error message\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Step 5: Generate Swedish Translations\n\nFor each translatable string:\n\n1. **Understand the context** - What is this text doing? What action/state does it represent?\n2. **Check references** - Is there domain terminology or existing pattern?\n3. **Choose natural Swedish** - Prioritize natural phrasing over literal translation\n4. **Maintain interpolation** - Preserve `{{variables}}` for dynamic content\n5. **Apply grammar** - Ensure proper Swedish grammar (gender, plural, word order)\n\n**Example process:**\n\nEnglish: \"Add Player to Team\"\n1. Context: Button action to add a player\n2. Check: \"Add\" → \"Lägg till\" (from existing-translations.md)\n3. Natural: \"Lägg till Spelare i Laget\"\n4. No interpolation needed\n5. Grammar: ✅ Natural Swedish word order\n\nEnglish: \"You have selected {{count}} players\"\n1. Context: Feedback message showing selection count\n2. Check: \"Select\" → \"Välj\" → \"Vald/Valda\"\n3. Natural: \"Du har valt {{count}} spelare\"\n4. Keep: `{{count}}` variable\n5. Grammar: ✅ \"Valda\" plural form matches \"spelare\"\n\n### Step 6: Update Translation Files\n\nUpdate or create JSON files in `src/locales/sv/{namespace}.json`:\n\n**If file exists:**\n- Read current content\n- Merge new translations (preserve existing keys)\n- Maintain nested structure\n- Keep consistent formatting\n\n**If creating new file:**\n- Create both `src/locales/en/{namespace}.json` (English) and `src/locales/sv/{namespace}.json` (Swedish)\n- Update `src/locales/i18n.js` to import new namespace files\n- Add namespace to i18n.init resources configuration\n\n**Example update to existing file:**\n\nBefore:\n```json\n{\n  \"header\": {\n    \"title\": \"Spel- och Lagkonfiguration\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\nAfter (adding new section):\n```json\n{\n  \"header\": {\n    \"title\": \"Spel- och Lagkonfiguration\"\n  },\n  \"buttons\": {\n    \"save\": \"Spara\",\n    \"cancel\": \"Avbryt\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Step 7: Update Component Code\n\nModify the component to use translations:\n\n1. **Add import** (if not present):\n```javascript\nimport { useTranslation } from ''react-i18next'';\n```\n\n2. **Add hook** (if not present):\n```javascript\nconst { t } = useTranslation(''namespace'');\n```\n\n3. **Replace hardcoded strings** with `t()` calls:\n\nBefore:\n```javascript\n<h1>Game & Squad Configuration</h1>\n<button>Save Configuration</button>\n<p>You have selected {count} players</p>\n```\n\nAfter:\n```javascript\n<h1>{t(''configuration:header.title'')}</h1>\n<button>{t(''common:buttons.save'')}</button>\n<p>{t(''configuration:squad.selectTitle'', { count })}</p>\n```\n\n**Translation key format:**\n- Same namespace: `t(''key.path'')`\n- Different namespace: `t(''namespace:key.path'')`\n- With variables: `t(''key.path'', { variable: value })`\n\n4. **Handle multi-namespace usage**:\n\nIf component uses multiple namespaces:\n```javascript\n// Option 1: Multiple useTranslation calls\nconst { t } = useTranslation(''configuration'');\nconst { t: tCommon } = useTranslation(''common'');\n\n// Option 2: Single call with array\nconst { t } = useTranslation([''configuration'', ''common'']);\n// Then use: t(''configuration:key'') or t(''common:key'')\n```\n\n### Step 8: Verify Implementation\n\nAfter updates:\n\n1. **Check JSON validity** - Ensure valid JSON syntax (no trailing commas, proper quotes)\n2. **Check i18n.js** - Verify new namespaces are imported and registered\n3. **Check imports** - Ensure component has correct useTranslation import\n4. **Check keys** - Verify all translation keys exist in JSON files\n5. **Check variables** - Ensure interpolation variables match between English and Swedish\n\n## Domain-Specific Guidelines\n\n### Soccer Terminology\n\n**Always use soccer-specific Swedish terms:**\n- Defender → \"Back\" (NOT \"Försvarare\")\n- Midfielder → \"Mittfält\"\n- Forward/Attacker → \"Forward\"\n- Goalkeeper → \"Målvakt\"\n- Substitute → \"Avbytare\"\n\n**For positions, use natural Swedish compounds:**\n- Left Back → \"Vänsterback\"\n- Right Midfielder → \"Höger mittfält\"\n- Left Forward → \"Vänsterforward\"\n\nSee `references/soccer-terminology.md` for complete glossary.\n\n### Natural Swedish Phrasing\n\n**Prioritize natural word order:**\n- ❌ \"Application Language\" → \"Applikationsspråk\" (too literal)\n- ✅ \"Application Language\" → \"Språk i appen\" (natural)\n\n**Use appropriate compounds:**\n- ✅ \"matchformat\" (one word)\n- ✅ \"lagkapten\" (one word)\n- ❌ \"motståndarlagsnamn\" (too long, use \"motståndarlags namn\")\n\n**Use natural actions:**\n- ❌ \"Addera Spelare\" (too formal)\n- ✅ \"Lägg till Spelare\" (natural)\n\nSee `references/translation-patterns.md` for patterns and examples.\n\n### Consistency with Codebase\n\n**Always check existing translations first:**\n- Read `references/existing-translations.md` for established patterns\n- Use same terms for same concepts across the app\n- Maintain consistent namespace organization\n\n**Common established terms:**\n- Squad → \"Trupp\"\n- Team → \"Lag\"\n- Game/Match → \"Match\" (always)\n- Period → \"Period\"\n- Rotation → \"Byte\"\n\n## Common Mistakes to Avoid\n\n❌ **Literal translation without context**\n- \"Defender\" → \"Försvarare\" (wrong - should be \"Back\")\n\n❌ **Ignoring natural Swedish word order**\n- \"Application Language\" → \"Applikationsspråk\" (wrong - should be \"Språk i appen\")\n\n❌ **Translating names**\n- \"Sport Wizard\" → \"Sport Trollkarl\" (wrong - keep original)\n\n❌ **Inconsistent terminology**\n- Using both \"Trupp\" and \"Lag\" for \"squad\" (wrong - use \"Trupp\" consistently)\n\n❌ **Breaking interpolation**\n- Original: \"Selected: {{count}}\"\n- Wrong: \"Valda: {antal}\" (changed variable name)\n- Correct: \"Valda: {{count}}\" (kept variable name)\n\n❌ **Not updating component code**\n- Only creating JSON files without updating components to use t() calls\n\n## Output Format\n\nAfter completing translation, provide:\n\n1. **Summary** of what was translated\n2. **Translation files** created/updated (show file paths and new content)\n3. **Component changes** made (show the diff or updated code sections)\n4. **Namespace info** if new namespace was created (show i18n.js updates)\n\nExample output:\n\n```\nTranslated ConfigurationScreen to Swedish:\n\nUpdated files:\n- src/locales/sv/configuration.json (added 15 new keys)\n- src/locales/en/configuration.json (added 15 new keys)\n- src/components/setup/ConfigurationScreen.js (replaced hardcoded strings with t() calls)\n\nNew translation keys added:\n- squad.selectTitle\n- squad.addPlayerTitle\n- buttons.saveConfig\n- goalies.header\n...\n\nComponent now uses useTranslation(''configuration'') hook with proper t() calls.\n```\n\n## Notes\n\n- **Always read the component first** - Don''t translate blindly\n- **Context is king** - Same English word may have different Swedish translations based on context\n- **Natural over literal** - Swedish should sound natural to native speakers\n- **Consistency matters** - Check existing translations to maintain app-wide consistency\n- **Test interpolation** - Ensure {{variables}} work correctly in Swedish sentences\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:01:58.600Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Language Agents needing domain-specific Swedish translation capabilities for soccer coaching applications.","zh":"非常适合需要领域特定瑞典语翻译能力的语言代理，特别是用于足球教练应用程序。","ja":"サッカー コーチング アプリケーション向けのドメイン固有のスウェーデン語翻訳機能を必要とする言語エージェントに最適です。","ko":"도메인 특정 스웨덴어 번역 기능이 필요한 언어 에이전트에게 적합하며, 특히 축구 코칭 애플리케이션에 사용됩니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Lenguaje que necesitan capacidades de traducción específicas de dominio en sueco para aplicaciones de entrenamiento de fútbol.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Langue nécessitant des capacités de traduction spécifiques au domaine en suédois pour les applications d''entraînement de football.","de":"Perfekt für Sprachagenten, die domänen-spezifische schwedische Übersetzungsfähigkeiten für Fußball-Training-Anwendungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agents de Linguagem que necessitam de capacidades de tradução específicas do domínio sueco para aplicações de treinamento de futebol.","ru":"Идеально подходит для языковых агентов, которым требуются домен-специфические возможности перевода с шведского для приложений по футбольному тренеру.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء اللغويين الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات ترجمة خاصة بالдомين السويدي لتطبيقات تدريب كرة القدم."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate natural, context-aware Swedish translations using deep context analysis and domain-appropriate soccer terminology, prioritizing consistency and natural phrasing over literal translations.","zh":"使代理能够使用深度上下文分析和领域适当的足球术语生成自然、上下文感知的瑞典语翻译，优先考虑一致性和自然的措辞而不是逐字翻译。","ja":"エージェントが、深いコンテキスト分析とドメインに適したサッカー用語を使用して、自然でコンテキストに応じたスウェーデン語の翻訳を生成できるようにします。一致性と自然なフレージングを優先し、逐語的翻訳よりも優れています。","ko":"에이전트가 깊은 문맥 분석 및 도메인에 적합한 축구 용어를 사용하여 자연스럽고 문맥에 맞는 스웨덴어 번역을 생성할 수 있도록 합니다. 일관성과 자연스러운 어휘를 우선시하여 직역보다 우수합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar traducciones naturales y conscientes del contexto en sueco utilizando un análisis de contexto profundo y terminología de fútbol adecuada para el dominio, priorizando la coherencia y la fraseología natural sobre las traducciones literales.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des traductions suédoises naturelles et conscientes du contexte en utilisant une analyse de contexte approfondie et une terminologie de football appropriée pour le domaine, en donnant la priorité à la cohérence et à la phraséologie naturelle plutôt qu''aux traductions littérales.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, natürliche, kontext-bewusste schwedische Übersetzungen zu erstellen, indem sie eine tiefe Kontextanalyse und eine domänen-angemessene Fußball-Terminologie verwenden, wobei Konsistenz und natürliche Formulierungen Vorrang vor wörtlichen Übersetzungen haben.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar traduções suecas naturais e conscientes do contexto usando análise de contexto profunda e terminologia de futebol apropriada ao domínio, priorizando a consistência e a fraseologia natural em detrimento de traduções literais.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать естественные, контекстно-осведомлённые шведские переводы с использованием глубокого контекстного анализа и домен-специфической футбольной терминологии, отдаёт предпочтение последовательности и естественной фразеологии над буквальными переводами.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من توليد ترجمات سويدية طبيعية وواعية للسياق باستخدام تحليل سياق عميق ومصطلحات كرة قدم مناسبة للنطاق، مع أولوية للاتساق والتوصيف الطبيعي على الترجمات الحرفية."},"useCases":{"en":["Translating Sport Wizard application text for 5v5 coaching tools","Generating Swedish soccer terminology for coaching applications","Enhancing soccer coaching tools with accurate, context-aware translations"],"zh":["翻译5v5教练工具的体育巫师应用程序文本","为教练应用程序生成瑞典语足球术语","使用准确、上下文感知的翻译来增强足球教练工具"],"ja":["5v5コーチング ツールのスポーツ ウィザード アプリケーション テキストの翻訳","コーチング アプリケーション向けのスウェーデン語サッカー用語の生成","正確でコンテキストに応じた翻訳を使用してサッカー コーチング ツールを強化する"],"ko":["5v5 코칭 툴을 위한 스포츠 위자드 애플리케이션 텍스트 번역","코칭 애플리케이션을 위한 스웨덴어 축구 용어 생성","정확하고 문맥에 맞는 번역을 사용하여 축구 코칭 툴을 강화하는 것"],"es":["Traducir texto de la aplicación Sport Wizard para herramientas de entrenamiento 5v5","Generar terminología de fútbol en sueco para aplicaciones de entrenamiento","Mejorar las herramientas de entrenamiento de fútbol con traducciones precisas y conscientes del contexto"],"fr":["Traduire le texte de l''application Sport Wizard pour les outils d''entraînement 5v5","Générer une terminologie de football en suédois pour les applications d''entraînement","Améliorer les outils d''entraînement de football avec des traductions précises et conscientes du contexte"],"de":["Übersetzen von Texten der Sport Wizard-Anwendung für 5v5-Trainingstools","Generieren von schwedischer Fußball-Terminologie für Training-Anwendungen","Verbessern von Fußball-Trainingstools mit genauen, kontext-bewussten Übersetzungen"],"pt":["Traduzir texto do aplicativo Sport Wizard para ferramentas de treinamento 5v5","Gerar terminologia de futebol sueca para aplicações de treinamento","Melhorar ferramentas de treinamento de futebol com traduções precisas e conscientes do contexto"],"ru":["Переводить текст приложения Sport Wizard для инструментов тренировки 5v5","Генерировать шведскую футбольную терминологию для приложений тренировки","Улучшать инструменты тренировки футбола точными и контекстно-осведомлёнными переводами"],"ar":["ترجمة نص تطبيق Sport Wizard لأدوات تدريب 5v5","توليد مصطلحات كرة قدم سويدية لتطبيقات التدريب","تحسين أدوات تدريب كرة القدم بالترجمات الدقيقة والواعية للسياق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Limited to Swedish translations","Requires domain-specific knowledge of soccer terminology","Designed specifically for soccer coaching applications"],"zh":["仅限瑞典语翻译","需要足球术语的领域特定知识","专门为足球教练应用程序设计"],"ja":["スウェーデン語の翻訳のみ","サッカー用語のドメイン固有の知識が必要","サッカー コーチング アプリケーションのみを対象として設計"],"ko":["스웨덴어 번역만 가능","축구 용어에 대한 도메인 특정 지식이 필요","축구 코칭 애플리케이션 전용으로 설계"],"es":["Limitado a traducciones al sueco","Requiere conocimientos específicos del dominio de la terminología de fútbol","Diseñado específicamente para aplicaciones de entrenamiento de fútbol"],"fr":["Limité aux traductions en suédois","Nécessite des connaissances spécifiques du domaine de la terminologie de football","Conçu spécifiquement pour les applications d''entraînement de football"],"de":["Begrenzt auf schwedische Übersetzungen","Benötigt domänen-spezifische Kenntnisse der Fußball-Terminologie","Speziell für Fußball-Training-Anwendungen konzipiert"],"pt":["Limitado a traduções suecas","Requer conhecimento específico do domínio de terminologia de futebol","Projetado especificamente para aplicações de treinamento de futebol"],"ru":["Ограничен шведскими переводами","Требует домен-специфических знаний футбольной терминологии","Разработан специально для приложений по футбольному тренеру"],"ar":["محدود بالترجمات السويدية","يتطلب معرفة خاصة بالنطاق لمصطلحات كرة القدم","صمّم خصيصًا لتطبيقات تدريب كرة القدم"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"e28e4b4085fc20da49a534e18d0022f6474280ec93f208d3b813142139adba62","qualityScore":57}');
