환경을 생성, 관리, 최적화하는 것을 말함","es":"Manage-python-env es una habilidad de administración de entornos de Python que utiliza uv para crear y gestionar entornos virtuales","fr":"Manage-python-env est une compétence de gestion d''environnements Python qui utilise uv pour créer et gérer des environnements virtuels","de":"Manage-python-env ist eine Fähigkeit zur Verwaltung von Python-Umgebungen, die uv verwendet, um virtuelle Umgebungen zu erstellen und zu verwalten","pt":"O que é manage-python-env? É uma habilidade para gerenciar ambientes virtuais Python","ru":"Что такое manage-python-env? Это навык для управления виртуальными средами Python","ar":"ما هو manage-python-env؟ هي مهارة لإدارة البيئات الافتراضية لبايثون"},"features":{"en":["Installs uv for fast Python package installation","Creates new virtual environments using uv","Installs dependencies from requirements.txt or pyproject.toml","Manages environment updates, freezes, and cleanups","Troubleshoots common issues with uv"],"zh":["使用 uv 快速安装 Python 虚拟环境","创建和管理依赖项","更新、冻结或清理依赖项","解决依赖项冲突","优化 Python 开发流程"],"ja":["uv を使用して Python の仮想環境を迅速にインストール","依存関係を作成して管理","依存関係を更新、フリーズ、またはクリーンアップ","依存関係のコンフリクトを解決","Python 開発プロセスを最適化"],"ko":["uv를 사용하여 파이썬 가상 환경을 빠르게 설치","의존성을 생성하고 관리","의존성을 업데이트하거나 동결 또는 정리","의존성 충돌을 해결","파이썬 개발 프로세스를 최적화"],"es":["Creación de entornos virtuales con uv","Gestión de dependencias con requirements.txt o pyproject.toml","Actualización y congelación de dependencias","Limpieza de dependencias","Resolución de conflictos de dependencias"],"fr":["Création d''environnements virtuels avec uv","Gestion des dépendances avec requirements.txt ou pyproject.toml","Mise à jour et gel des dépendances","Nettoyage des dépendances","Résolution des conflits de dépendances"],"de":["Erstellung von virtuellen Umgebungen mit uv","Verwaltung von Abhängigkeiten mit requirements.txt oder pyproject.toml","Aktualisierung und Einfrieren von Abhängigkeiten","Bereinigung von Abhängigkeiten","Auflösung von Abhängigkeitskonflikten"],"pt":["Criação de ambientes virtuais Python usando uv","Instalação de dependências a partir de requirements.txt ou pyproject.toml","Gerenciamento de pacotes e dependências","Atualização e congelamento de dependências","Limpeza de ambientes virtuais"],"ru":["Создание виртуальных сред Python с помощью uv","Установка зависимостей из requirements.txt или pyproject.toml","Управление пакетами и зависимостями","Обновление и замораживание зависимостей","Очистка виртуальных сред"],"ar":["إنشاء بيئات افتراضية لبايثون باستخدام uv","تثبيت الإعتماديات من requirements.txt أو pyproject.toml","إدارة الحزم والإعتماديات","تحديث وتجمد الإعتماديات","تنظيف البيئات الافتراضية"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use manage-python-env","manage-python-env setup guide","uv package installer","python virtual environment management","manage-python-env alternative","manage-python-env vs pip","install manage-python-env","python environment troubleshooting","manage-python-env best practices"],"zh":["Python 环境管理","uv安装","虚拟环境管理","依赖项管理","Python 开发工具","AIエージェント","Python 环境设置"],"ja":["Python 環境管理","uv インストール","仮想環境管理","依存関係管理","Python 開発ツール","AIエージェント","Python 環境設定"],"ko":["파이썬 환경 관리","uv 설치","가상 환경 관리","의존성 관리","파이썬 개발 도구","AI 에이전트","파이썬 환경 설정"],"es":["manage-python-env","administración de entornos de Python","entornos virtuales de Python","uv","gestión de dependencias","requirements.txt","pyproject.toml","Herramientas de desarrollo de Python"],"fr":["manage-python-env","gestion d''environnements Python","environnements virtuels Python","uv","gestion des dépendances","requirements.txt","pyproject.toml","Outils de développement Python"],"de":["manage-python-env","Verwaltung von Python-Umgebungen","virtuelle Python-Umgebungen","uv","Verwaltung von Abhängigkeiten","requirements.txt","pyproject.toml","Python-Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["manage-python-env","ambientes virtuais python","uv","gerenciamento de dependências","criação de ambientes","instalação de pacotes","python","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["manage-python-env","виртуальные среды python","uv","управление зависимостями","создание сред","установка пакетов","python","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["manage-python-env","بيئات افتراضية لبايثون","uv","إدارة الإعتماديات","إنشاء بيئات","تثبيت الحزم","بايثون","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"dudusoar","repo":"sdr-sentiment-analysis","repoPath":"dudusoar/sdr-sentiment-analysis","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.316Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"manage-python-env","description":"Python virtual environment management using uv for fast and reliable environment setup. Create, maintain, and manage Python virtual environments with dependency management. Use uv for environment creation, package installation, dependency resolution, and project configuration. Use when setting up new Python projects, managing dependencies, troubleshooting environment issues, or ensuring reproducible development environments.","bodyPreview":"# Python Environment Management Skill\n\nThis skill provides tools and workflows for managing Python virtual environments using uv, a fast Python package installer and resolver.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n1. **Install uv**: Ensure uv is installed on your system\n2. **Create environment**: Use uv to create a new virtual environment\n3. **Install dependencies**: Add packages from requirements.txt or pyproject.toml\n4. **Manage environment**: Update, freeze, or clean up dependencies\n5. **Troubleshoot**: Resolve c","body":"# Python Environment Management Skill\n\nThis skill provides tools and workflows for managing Python virtual environments using uv, a fast Python package installer and resolver.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n1. **Install uv**: Ensure uv is installed on your system\n2. **Create environment**: Use uv to create a new virtual environment\n3. **Install dependencies**: Add packages from requirements.txt or pyproject.toml\n4. **Manage environment**: Update, freeze, or clean up dependencies\n5. **Troubleshoot**: Resolve common environment issues\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n### 1. Environment Setup\n```bash\n# Initialize project with uv\nuv init project-name\ncd project-name\n\n# Create virtual environment\nuv venv\n\n# Activate environment\n# On Windows:\n.venv\\Scripts\\activate\n# On Unix/Mac:\nsource .venv/bin/activate\n```\n\n### 2. Dependency Management\n```bash\n# Install packages\nuv add package-name\nuv add \"package-name>=1.0.0\"\nuv add \"package-name[extra]\"\n\n# Install from requirements.txt\nuv pip install -r requirements.txt\n\n# Install with development dependencies\nuv add --dev pytest black\n```\n\n### 3. Project Configuration\n```bash\n# Generate requirements.txt\nuv pip freeze > requirements.txt\n\n# Sync environment\nuv sync\n\n# Update packages\nuv update\nuv update package-name\n```\n\n## uv vs Traditional Tools\n\n### Advantages of uv\n- **Speed**: 10-100x faster than pip\n- **Reliability**: Better dependency resolution\n- **Unified tool**: Replaces pip, venv, pip-tools\n- **Cross-platform**: Consistent behavior across systems\n- **Modern features**: Built-in virtual environments, lock files\n\n### Command Comparison\n| Task | uv Command | Traditional Command |\n|------|------------|---------------------|\n| Create venv | `uv venv` | `python -m venv .venv` |\n| Install package | `uv add package` | `pip install package` |\n| Install dev package | `uv add --dev package` | `pip install package` |\n| Freeze deps | `uv pip freeze` | `pip freeze` |\n| Sync env | `uv sync` | `pip install -r requirements.txt` |\n| Update package | `uv update package` | `pip install --upgrade package` |\n\n## Environment Types\n\n### Development Environment\n```bash\n# Complete development setup\nuv venv\nuv add --dev pytest black flake8 mypy\nuv add pandas numpy matplotlib\nuv sync\n```\n\n### Production Environment\n```bash\n# Production-ready with pinned versions\nuv venv --python 3.11\nuv add \"package==1.2.3\"  # Pin exact versions\nuv pip compile requirements.in -o requirements.txt\n```\n\n### CI/CD Environment\n```bash\n# Minimal environment for CI\nuv venv --python 3.11\nuv add --no-dev package-name\nuv sync --frozen\n```\n\n## Project Structure\n\n### Recommended Layout\n```\nproject/\n├── .venv/                 # Virtual environment (gitignored)\n├── src/                   # Source code\n├── tests/                 # Test files\n├── pyproject.toml         # Project configuration\n├── requirements.txt       # Pinned dependencies\n├── requirements-dev.txt   # Development dependencies\n└── .python-version       # Python version specification\n```\n\n### Configuration Files\n\n#### pyproject.toml\n```toml\n[project]\nname = \"my-project\"\nversion = \"0.1.0\"\ndescription = \"My project description\"\nrequires-python = \">=3.8\"\ndependencies = [\n    \"requests>=2.28.0\",\n    \"pandas>=1.5.0\",\n]\n\n[project.optional-dependencies]\ndev = [\n    \"pytest>=7.0.0\",\n    \"black>=23.0.0\",\n    \"flake8>=6.0.0\",\n]\n\n[tool.uv]\n# uv-specific settings\n```\n\n#### requirements.txt\n```\n# Pinned dependencies\nrequests==2.28.2\npandas==1.5.3\nnumpy==1.24.3\n```\n\n## Common Workflows\n\n### New Project Setup\n```bash\n# 1. Create project directory\nmkdir my-project && cd my-project\n\n# 2. Initialize with uv\nuv init\n\n# 3. Create virtual environment\nuv venv\n\n# 4. Activate environment\nsource .venv/bin/activate  # or .venv\\Scripts\\activate on Windows\n\n# 5. Add initial dependencies\nuv add requests pandas\nuv add --dev pytest black\n\n# 6. Create basic project structure\nmkdir src tests\ntouch src/__init__.py tests/__init__.py\n\n# 7. Create .gitignore\necho \".venv/\" >> .gitignore\necho \"__pycache__/\" >> .gitignore\necho \"*.pyc\" >> .gitignore\n```\n\n### Existing Project Setup\n```bash\n# 1. Clone repository\ngit clone https://github.com/user/project.git\ncd project\n\n# 2. Create environment with specific Python version\nuv venv --python 3.11\n\n# 3. Install dependencies\nuv sync\n\n# 4. Activate environment\nsource .venv/bin/activate\n```\n\n**Real-world example**: The YouTube-SC project includes complete setup scripts (`setup-environment.bat` and `setup-environment.sh`) and a comprehensive `requirements.txt` file. See `examples/youtube-sc/` for details.\n\n### Dependency Updates\n```bash\n# Check for updates\nuv update --outdated\n\n# Update all packages\nuv update\n\n# Update specific package\nuv update package-name\n\n# Update with constraints\nuv update --pre  # Include pre-release versions\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Common Issues\n\n#### 1. Environment Activation Fails\n**Symptoms**: `source .venv/bin/activate` doesn''t work\n**Solutions**:\n```bash\n# Check if .venv exists\nls -la .venv/\n\n# Try alternative activation\n. .venv/bin/activate  # Note the space after the dot\n\n# On Windows, use:\n.venv\\Scripts\\activate\n```\n\n#### 2. Package Installation Failures\n**Symptoms**: `uv add package` fails with errors\n**Solutions**:\n```bash\n# Clear uv cache\nuv cache clean\n\n# Try with verbose output\nuv add package -v\n\n# Check Python version compatibility\npython --version\n\n# Try different package version\nuv add \"package>=1.0.0,<2.0.0\"\n```\n\n#### 3. Dependency Conflicts\n**Symptoms**: `uv sync` fails with resolution errors\n**Solutions**:\n```bash\n# Use resolution strategy\nuv sync --resolution=highest\nuv sync --resolution=lowest-direct\n\n# Check existing dependencies\nuv pip list\n\n# Remove conflicting package\nuv remove conflicting-package\n```\n\n#### 4. Slow Package Installation\n**Symptoms**: uv is slow (unusual)\n**Solutions**:\n```bash\n# Use uv''s native resolver (already fast)\n# Check network connection\n\n# Use mirror or local cache\nuv config set global.index-url \"https://pypi.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/simple\"\n\n# Pre-download packages\nuv pip download package -d ./packages\n```\n\n## Advanced Features\n\n### Lock Files\n```bash\n# Generate lock file\nuv pip compile requirements.in -o requirements.txt\n\n# Install from lock file\nuv sync --frozen\n```\n\n### Multiple Python Versions\n```bash\n# Create environment with specific Python version\nuv venv --python 3.11\nuv venv --python 3.10\nuv venv --python 3.9\n\n# List available Python versions\nuv python list\n```\n\n### Environment Isolation\n```bash\n# Create isolated environment\nuv venv --isolated\n\n# Copy existing environment\nuv venv --copies\n```\n\n### Cross-Platform Compatibility\n```bash\n# Generate platform-specific requirements\nuv pip compile requirements.in --platform linux --platform macos --platform windows\n\n# Install platform-specific packages\nuv add \"package; sys_platform == ''linux''\"\n```\n\n## Integration with Other Tools\n\n### IDE Integration\n**VS Code**: Add to settings.json:\n```json\n{\n    \"python.defaultInterpreterPath\": \".venv/bin/python\",\n    \"terminal.integrated.env.windows\": {\n        \"VIRTUAL_ENV\": \"${workspaceFolder}/.venv\"\n    }\n}\n```\n\n**PyCharm**: \n- File → Settings → Project → Python Interpreter\n- Add → Existing environment → Select .venv/bin/python\n\n### Docker Integration\n```dockerfile\nFROM python:3.11-slim\n\n# Install uv\nRUN pip install uv\n\n# Copy project files\nCOPY . /app\nWORKDIR /app\n\n# Create virtual environment and install dependencies\nRUN uv venv && uv sync --frozen\n\n# Use the virtual environment\nENV PATH=\"/app/.venv/bin:$PATH\"\n\nCMD [\"python\", \"main.py\"]\n```\n\n### CI/CD Integration\n```yaml\n# GitHub Actions example\njobs:\n  test:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n      - uses: astral-sh/setup-uv@v3\n      - run: uv sync --frozen\n      - run: uv run pytest\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### 1. Version Pinning\n- Pin exact versions in production (`==`)\n- Use ranges in development (`>=`)\n- Maintain separate requirements files for dev/prod\n\n### 2. Environment Management\n- Keep `.venv` in project directory (not global)\n- Include `.venv` in `.gitignore`\n- Document Python version requirement\n\n### 3. Dependency Hygiene\n- Regularly update dependencies\n- Remove unused packages\n- Audit for security vulnerabilities\n\n### 4. Reproducibility\n- Use lock files for exact reproducibility\n- Document environment setup in README\n- Test across Python versions\n\n## Resources\n\n- **uv Documentation**: See `references/uv-docs.md` for complete uv reference\n- **Common Recipes**: See `references/recipes.md` for common environment setups\n- **Troubleshooting Guide**: See `references/troubleshooting.md` for solving common issues\n- **Migration Guide**: See `references/migration.md` for migrating from pip/venv\n- **Project Examples**: See `examples/youtube-sc/` for real-world configuration files from the YouTube-SC project\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when:\n\n- Setting up new Python projects\n- Managing dependencies for existing projects\n- Troubleshooting environment issues\n- Creating reproducible environments\n- Migrating from pip/venv to uv\n- Setting up CI/CD pipelines\n- Managing multiple Python versions\n- Ensuring cross-platform compatibility"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:02:48.995Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Python Development Agents needing streamlined environment setup and dependency management.","zh":"非常适合需要简化环境设置和依赖管理的Python开发代理。","ja":"Python開発エージェントがストリームライン化された環境設定と依存関係管理を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"환경 설정과 종속성 관리를 단순화해야 하는 Python 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo de Python que necesitan una configuración de entorno y gestión de dependencias optimizadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement Python ayant besoin d''une configuration d''environnement et d''une gestion de dépendances rationalisées.","de":"Perfekt für Python-Entwicklungsagenten, die eine optimierte Umgebungssetup und Abhängigkeitsverwaltung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Python que necessitam de configuração de ambiente simplificada e gerenciamento de dependências.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки Python, которым необходима упрощенная настройка среды и управление зависимостями.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء النمطية بايثون الذين يحتاجون إلى إعداد بيئة مبسط وإدارة الاعتماديات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to efficiently manage Python virtual environments using uv, a fast Python package installer and resolver, streamlining dependency installation from requirements.txt or pyproject.toml files and troubleshooting environment issues.","zh":"通过uv，一个快速的Python包安装器和解析器，赋予代理高效地管理Python虚拟环境的能力，简化从requirements.txt或pyproject.toml文件中安装依赖项，并排除环境问题。","ja":"uvという高速なPythonパッケージインストーラーと解決策を使用して、Python開発エージェントがPythonの仮想環境を効率的に管理できるようにし、requirements.txtまたはpyproject.tomlファイルからの依存関係のインストールを簡素化し、環境の問題をトラブルシューティングします。","ko":"uv라는 빠른 Python 패키지 설치 프로그램과 해결사를 통해 에이전트가 Python 가상 환경을 효율적으로 관리할 수 있도록 하여 requirements.txt 또는 pyproject.toml 파일에서 종속성 설치를 단순화하고 환경 문제를 해결합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar de manera eficiente los entornos virtuales de Python utilizando uv, un instalador y resolutor de paquetes Python rápido, lo que simplifica la instalación de dependencias desde archivos requirements.txt o pyproject.toml y la resolución de problemas de entorno.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer efficacement les environnements virtuels Python en utilisant uv, un installateur et résolveur de packages Python rapide, ce qui rationalise l''installation des dépendances à partir des fichiers requirements.txt ou pyproject.toml et la résolution des problèmes d''environnement.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Python-Virtualumgebungen effizient mithilfe von uv, einem schnellen Python-Paket-Installer und -Resolver, zu verwalten, wodurch die Installation von Abhängigkeiten aus Dateien requirements.txt oder pyproject.toml vereinfacht und die Fehlerbehebung bei Umgebungsproblemen verbessert wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar de forma eficiente ambientes virtuais Python usando uv, um instalador e resolvedor de pacotes Python rápido, simplificando a instalação de dependências de arquivos requirements.txt ou pyproject.toml e solucionando problemas de ambiente.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью эффективно управлять виртуальными средами Python с помощью uv, быстрого инсталлятора и решателя пакетов Python, что упрощает установку зависимостей из файлов requirements.txt или pyproject.toml и решение проблем среды.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إدارة البيئات الافتراضية بايثون بفعالية باستخدام uv، وهو مثبت وحل مقاتل حزم بايثون سريع، مما يبسط عملية تثبيت الاعتماديات من ملفات requirements.txt أو pyproject.toml وعلاج مشاكل البيئة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating environment setup for new projects","Updating and freezing dependencies for reproducibility","Troubleshooting and cleaning up environment issues"],"zh":["为新项目自动设置环境","更新和固定依赖项以实现可复现性","排除和清理环境问题"],"ja":["新しいプロジェクトの環境設定を自動化する","再現性のために依存関係を更新して固定する","環境の問題をトラブルシューティングしてクリーンアップする"],"ko":["새 프로젝트를 위한 환경 설정 자동화","재현성을 위해 종속 항목 업데이트 및 고정","환경 문제 해결 및 정리"],"es":["Automatizar la configuración del entorno para nuevos proyectos","Actualizar y congelar dependencias para la reproducibilidad","Solucionar y limpiar problemas de entorno"],"fr":["Automatiser la configuration de l''environnement pour les nouveaux projets","Mettre à jour et geler les dépendances pour la reproductibilité","Résoudre et nettoyer les problèmes d''environnement"],"de":["Automatisieren der Umgebungssetup für neue Projekte","Aktualisieren und Einfrieren von Abhängigkeiten für die Reproduzierbarkeit","Fehlerbehebung und Bereinigung von Umgebungsproblemen"],"pt":["Automatizar a configuração do ambiente para novos projetos","Atualizar e congelar dependências para reprodutibilidade","Solucionar e limpar problemas de ambiente"],"ru":["Автоматизация настройки среды для новых проектов","Обновление и заморозка зависимостей для воспроизводимости","Устранение и очистка проблем среды"],"ar":["تحسين إعداد البيئة لل مشاريع الجديدة","تحديث وتجميد الاعتماديات من أجل إعادة الإنتاج","معالجة مشاكل البيئة وتنظيفها"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires uv installation","Limited to Python virtual environments"],"zh":["需要uv安装","仅限Python虚拟环境"],"ja":["uvのインストールが必要","Python仮想環境のみ"],"ko":["uv 설치 필요","Python 가상 환경만 해당"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de uv","Limitado a entornos virtuales de Python"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de uv","Limité aux environnements virtuels Python"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation von uv","Begrenzt auf Python-Virtualumgebungen"],"pt":["Requer instalação do uv","Limitado a ambientes virtuais Python"],"ru":["Требуется установка uv","Ограничен только виртуальными средами Python"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت uv","محدود بالبيئات الافتراضية بايثون فقط"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"2ca3988cee7b315ae30cb0cd10808290c162aa937a272fcda4e3ee419bd043aa","qualityScore":57}');
