providing a single source of truth for multiple AI coding assistants, and generates Product Requirements Documents (PRD) in Markdown format.","zh":"create-prd是一种创建产品需求文档的技能，基于Universal Context Architecture","ja":"create-prdは、Universal Context Architectureに基づくプロダクト要件文書を作成するスキルです","ko":"create-prd는 유니버설 컨텍스트 아키텍처 기반의 제품 요구사항 문서를 생성하는 스킬입니다","es":"Create-prd es una herramienta de inteligencia artificial que crea documentos de requisitos de producto","fr":"Create-prd est un outil d''intelligence artificielle qui crée des documents de spécifications de produit","de":"Create-prd ist ein KI-Tool, das Produktanforderungsdokumente erstellt","pt":"O Create-PRD é uma ferramenta que cria documentos de requisitos de produto (PRD) em formato Markdown","ru":"Create-PRD - это инструмент, создающий документы требований продукта (PRD) в формате Markdown","ar":"Create-PRD هو أداة لإنشاء مستندات متطلبات المنتج (PRD) بصيغة Markdown"},"features":{"en":["Generates detailed Product Requirements Documents (PRD) in Markdown format","Supports 19+ AI coding assistants, including Cursor, Claude Code, and GitHub Copilot","Asks clarifying questions to ensure clear and actionable PRD","Provides a universal context architecture for AI coding assistants","Suitable for junior developers to understand and implement features"],"zh":["支持Universal Context Architecture","创建清晰、可行的产品需求文档","适用于初级开发人员","集成Cursor、Claude Code、GitHub Copilot等19+ AI编码助手","基于Markdown格式的文档创建","初级开发人员也能理解和实现的功能"],"ja":["Universal Context Architectureをサポート","初心者でも理解しやすい詳細なプロダクト要件文書を作成","初級開発者向け","Cursor、Claude Code、GitHub Copilotなど19以上のAIコーディングアシスタントを統合","Markdown形式の文書作成","初級開発者でも実装可能な機能"],"ko":["유니버설 컨텍스트 아키텍처 지원","초급 개발자도 이해하기 쉬운 제품 요구사항 문서 생성","초급 개발자를 위한 기능","Cursor, Claude Code, GitHub Copilot 등 19가지 이상의 AI 코딩 도우미 통합","Markdown 형식의 문서 생성","초급 개발자도 구현 가능한 기능"],"es":["Compatibilidad con Cursor, Claude Code y GitHub Copilot","Creación de documentos de requisitos de producto en formato Markdown","Soporte para la arquitectura de contexto universal","Generación de documentos claros y acciónables para desarrolladores junior","Integración con 19+ asistentes de codificación de IA","Proceso de creación de documentos de requisitos de producto basado en un prompt inicial del usuario"],"fr":["Compatibilité avec Cursor, Claude Code et GitHub Copilot","Création de documents de spécifications de produit au format Markdown","Support de l''architecture de contexte universel","Génération de documents clairs et actionnables pour les développeurs junior","Intégration avec 19+ assistants de codage IA","Processus de création de documents de spécifications de produit basé sur un prompt initial de l''utilisateur"],"de":["Kompatibilität mit Cursor, Claude Code und GitHub Copilot","Erstellung von Produktanforderungsdokumenten im Markdown-Format","Unterstützung für die universelle Kontextarchitektur","Generierung von klaren und handhabbaren Dokumenten für Junior-Entwickler","Integration mit 19+ KI-Coding-Assistenten","Erstellungsprozess für Produktanforderungsdokumente basierend auf einem initialen Benutzereingabe"],"pt":["Suporte a 19+ assistentes de codificação de IA","Criação de documentos de requisitos de produto (PRD) em formato Markdown","Arquitetura de contexto universal","Integração com Cursor, Claude Code, GitHub Copilot, Gemini, Amazon Q","Documentos claros e açãoaveis para desenvolvedores juniores"],"ru":["Поддержка 19+ ИИ кодировщиков","Создание документов требований продукта (PRD) в формате Markdown","Универсальная контекстная архитектура","Интеграция с Cursor, Claude Code, GitHub Copilot, Gemini, Amazon Q","Ясные и действенные документы для младших разработчиков"],"ar":["دعم 19+ مساعد الذكاء الاصطناعي للتعليم البرمجي","إنشاء مستندات متطلبات المنتج (PRD) بصيغة Markdown","هندسة سياق عالمية","التكامل مع Cursor و Claude Code و GitHub Copilot و Gemini و Amazon Q","مستندات واضحة وقابلة للتنفيذ لمطورين مبتدئين"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use create-prd","create-prd alternative","create-prd setup guide","what is create-prd","create-prd vs GitHub Copilot","create-prd install","universal context architecture","Product Requirements Document generation","AI coding assistants"],"zh":["create-prd","Universal Context Architecture","产品需求文档","AI编码助手","Markdown格式","初级开发人员","产品需求文档创建","AI工具","编码助手"],"ja":["create-prd","Universal Context Architecture","プロダクト要件文書","AIコーディングアシスタント","Markdown形式","初級開発者","プロダクト要件文書作成","AIエージェント","コーディングアシスタント"],"ko":["create-prd","유니버설 컨텍스트 아키텍처","제품 요구사항 문서","AI 코딩 도우미","Markdown 형식","초급 개발자","제품 요구사항 문서 생성","AI 도구","코딩 도우미"],"es":["create-prd","agentes de inteligencia artificial","documentos de requisitos de producto","Markdown","Cursor","Claude Code","GitHub Copilot","arquitectura de contexto universal","desarrolladores junior"],"fr":["create-prd","agents d''intelligence artificielle","documents de spécifications de produit","Markdown","Cursor","Claude Code","GitHub Copilot","architecture de contexte universel","développeurs junior"],"de":["create-prd","KI-Tools","Produktanforderungsdokumente","Markdown","Cursor","Claude Code","GitHub Copilot","universelle Kontextarchitektur","Junior-Entwickler"],"pt":["Create-PRD","ferramentas de IA","documentos de requisitos de produto","Markdown","desenvolvimento de software","assistente de codificação de IA","Cursor","Claude Code","GitHub Copilot","Gemini","Amazon Q"],"ru":["Create-PRD","ИИ Агенты","документы требований продукта","Markdown","разработка программного обеспечения","ИИ кодировщик","Cursor","Claude Code","GitHub Copilot","Gemini","Amazon Q"],"ar":["Create-PRD","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","مستندات متطلبات المنتج","Markdown","تطوير البرمجيات","مساعد الذكاء الاصطناعي للتعليم البرمجي","Cursor","Claude Code","GitHub Copilot","Gemini","Amazon Q"]}},"owner":"yokharian","repo":"AIBoilerplate","repoPath":"yokharian/AIBoilerplate","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.326Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"create-prd","description":"Creates detailed Product Requirements Documents (PRDs) in Markdown format. Use when the user asks to create a PRD, write product requirements, document a feature specification, or needs a structured requirements document for development.","bodyPreview":"# Creating Product Requirements Documents (PRD)\n\n## Goal\n\nTo guide the creation of a detailed Product Requirements Document (PRD) in Markdown format, based on an initial user prompt. The PRD should be clear, actionable, and suitable for a junior developer to understand and implement the feature.\n\n## Process\n\n1. **Receive Initial Prompt:** The user provides a brief description or request for a new feature or functionality.\n2. **Ask Clarifying Questions:** Before writing the PRD, you *must* ask on","body":"# Creating Product Requirements Documents (PRD)\n\n## Goal\n\nTo guide the creation of a detailed Product Requirements Document (PRD) in Markdown format, based on an initial user prompt. The PRD should be clear, actionable, and suitable for a junior developer to understand and implement the feature.\n\n## Process\n\n1. **Receive Initial Prompt:** The user provides a brief description or request for a new feature or functionality.\n2. **Ask Clarifying Questions:** Before writing the PRD, you *must* ask only the most essential clarifying questions needed to write a clear PRD. Limit questions to 3-5 critical gaps in understanding. The goal is to understand the \"what\" and \"why\" of the feature, not necessarily the \"how\" (which the developer will figure out). Make sure to provide options in letter/number lists so the user can respond easily with their selections.\n3. **Generate PRD:** Based on the initial prompt and the user''s answers to the clarifying questions, generate a PRD using the structure outlined below.\n4. **Save PRD:** Save the generated document as `prd.md` inside `.specify/features/[feature-name]/` directory. Create the feature directory if it doesn''t exist.\n\n## Clarifying Questions (Guidelines)\n\nAsk only the most critical questions needed to write a clear PRD. Focus on areas where the initial prompt is ambiguous\nor missing essential context. Common areas that may need clarification:\n\n* **Problem/Goal:** If unclear - \"What problem does this feature solve for the user?\"\n* **Core Functionality:** If vague - \"What are the key actions a user should be able to perform?\"\n* **Scope/Boundaries:** If broad - \"Are there any specific things this feature *should not* do?\"\n* **Success Criteria:** If unstated - \"How will we know when this feature is successfully implemented?\"\n\n**Important:** Only ask questions when the answer isn''t reasonably inferable from the initial prompt. Prioritize\nquestions that would significantly impact the PRD''s clarity.\n\n### Formatting Requirements\n\n* **Number all questions** (1, 2, 3, etc.)\n* **List options for each question as A, B, C, D, etc.** for easy reference\n* Make it simple for the user to respond with selections like \"1A, 2C, 3B\"\n\n### Example Format\n\n```text\n1. What is the primary goal of this feature?\n   A. Improve user onboarding experience\n   B. Increase user retention\n   C. Reduce support burden\n   D. Generate additional revenue\n\n2. Who is the target user for this feature?\n   A. New users only\n   B. Existing users only\n   C. All users\n   D. Admin users only\n\n3. What is the expected timeline for this feature?\n   A. Urgent (1-2 weeks)\n   B. High priority (3-4 weeks)\n   C. Standard (1-2 months)\n   D. Future consideration (3+ months)\n```\n\n## PRD Structure\n\nThe generated PRD should include the following sections:\n\n1. **Introduction/Overview:** Briefly describe the feature and the problem it solves. State the goal.\n2. **Goals:** List the specific, measurable objectives for this feature.\n3. **User Stories:** Detail the user narratives describing feature usage and benefits.\n4. **Functional Requirements:** List the specific functionalities the feature must have. Use clear, concise language (\n   e.g., \"The system must allow users to upload a profile picture.\"). Number these requirements.\n5. **Non-Goals (Out of Scope):** Clearly state what this feature will *not* include to manage scope.\n6. **Design Considerations (Optional):** Link to mockups, describe UI/UX requirements, or mention relevant\n   components/styles if applicable.\n7. **Technical Considerations (Optional):** Mention any known technical constraints, dependencies, or suggestions (\n   e.g., \"Should integrate with the existing Auth module\").\n8. **Success Metrics:** How will the success of this feature be measured? (e.g., \"Increase user engagement by 10%\", \"\n   Reduce support tickets related to X\").\n9. **Open Questions:** List any remaining questions or areas needing further clarification.\n\n## Target Audience\n\nAssume the primary reader of the PRD is a **junior developer**. Therefore, requirements should be explicit, unambiguous,\nand avoid jargon where possible. Provide enough detail for them to understand the feature''s purpose and core logic.\n\n## Output\n\n* **Format:** Markdown (`.md`)\n* **Location:** `.specify/features/[feature-name]/`\n* **Filename:** `prd.md`\n* **Full Path:** `.specify/features/[feature-name]/prd.md`\n\n## Final instructions\n\n1. Do NOT start implementing the PRD\n2. Make sure to ask the user clarifying questions\n3. Take the user''s answers to the clarifying questions and improve the PRD\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:03:02.243Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Technical Writing Agents and Developer Assistants like Cursor, Claude Code, and AutoGPT, needing to generate detailed Product Requirements Documents (PRD) in Markdown format.","zh":"适合于技术写作代理和开发助手，如Cursor、Claude Code和AutoGPT，需要生成详细的产品需求文档（PRD）以Markdown格式。","ja":"Cursor、Claude Code、AutoGPTなどのテクニカルライティングエージェントや開発者アシスタントに適しています。Markdown形式で詳細な製品要件文書（PRD）を生成する必要があります。","ko":"Cursor, Claude Code, AutoGPT와 같은 기술 문서 에이전트 및 개발자 어시스턴트에게 적합합니다. Markdown 형식으로詳細な 제품 요구 사항 문서 (PRD)를 생성해야 합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Escritura Técnica y Asistentes de Desarrolladores como Cursor, Claude Code y AutoGPT, que necesitan generar documentos de Requisitos de Producto (PRD) detallados en formato Markdown.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''écriture technique et les assistants de développeurs tels que Cursor, Claude Code et AutoGPT, qui ont besoin de générer des documents de spécifications de produit (PRD) détaillés au format Markdown.","de":"Ideal für technische Schreibagenten und Entwicklerassistenten wie Cursor, Claude Code und AutoGPT, die detaillierte Produktanforderungsdokumente (PRD) im Markdown-Format erstellen müssen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Escrita Técnica e Assistente de Desenvolvedores como Cursor, Claude Code e AutoGPT, necessitando gerar documentos de Requisitos de Produto (PRD) detalhados no formato Markdown.","ru":"Идеально подходит для технических агентов написания и помощников разработчиков, таких как Cursor, Claude Code и AutoGPT, которым необходимо создавать подробные документы требований продукта (PRD) в формате Markdown.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الكتابة الفنية و مساعد المطورين مثل Cursor و Claude Code و AutoGPT ، الذين يحتاجون إلى إنشاء مستندات متطلبات المنتج (PRD) مفصلة بالتنسيق Markdown."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create clear, actionable PRDs that guide junior developers through feature implementation, supporting 19+ AI coding assistants and utilizing Markdown format for easy readability and collaboration.","zh":"赋予代理创建清晰、可执行的PRD的能力，引导初级开发人员完成特性实现，支持19+个AI编码助手，并利用Markdown格式实现易读性和协作。","ja":"エージェントが明確で実行可能なPRDを作成できる機能を提供し、初級開発者が機能の実装を進めることができ、19以上のAIコーディングアシスタントをサポートし、Markdown形式を使用して可読性とコラボレーションを容易にします。","ko":"에이전트가 분명하고 실행 가능한 PRD를 생성할 수 있는 기능을 제공하여初级 개발자가 기능 구현을 안내할 수 있도록 지원하며, 19개 이상의 AI 코딩 도우미를 지원하며 Markdown 형식을 사용하여 가독성과 협력을 쉽게합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear PRD claros y ejecutables que guían a los desarrolladores junior a través de la implementación de funciones, apoyando a 19+ asistentes de codificación de IA y utilizando el formato Markdown para una fácil legibilidad y colaboración.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des PRD clairs et exécutables qui guident les développeurs junior à travers la mise en œuvre des fonctionnalités, en prenant en charge 19+ assistants de codage IA et en utilisant le format Markdown pour une lisibilité et une collaboration faciles.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, klare und ausführbare PRD zu erstellen, die junior-Entwickler durch die Funktionsimplementierung führen, und unterstützt 19+ künstliche Intelligenz-Coding-Assistenten sowie das Markdown-Format für einfache Lesbarkeit und Zusammenarbeit.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criarem PRDs claros e ações que orientam desenvolvedores juniors através da implementação de recursos, suportando 19+ assistentes de codificação de IA e utilizando o formato Markdown para fácil legibilidade e colaboração.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать четкие и действенные PRD, которые руководят младшими разработчиками через реализацию функций, поддерживая 19+ помощников кодирования ИИ и используя формат Markdown для простой читаемости и сотрудничества.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء مواصفات متطلبات المنتج (PRD) واضحة وقابلة للتنفيذ التي توجّه المطورين الجدد من خلال تنفيذ الميزات ، ودعم 19+ مساعدات برمجة إصدار AI ، واستخدام تنسيق Markdown من أجل سهولة القراءة والتعاون."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating PRDs for new feature requests","Assisting junior developers with implementation guidance","Creating detailed technical specifications for product development"],"zh":["为新功能请求生成PRD","为初级开发人员提供实现指导","为产品开发创建详细的技术规格"],"ja":["新しい機能リクエストのPRDを生成する","初級開発者への実装ガイダンスをサポートする","製品開発のための詳細な技術仕様を作成する"],"ko":["새로운 기능 요청에 대한 PRD 생성","초급 개발자를 위한 구현 지침 제공","제품 개발을 위한詳細한 기술 사양 생성"],"es":["Generar PRD para nuevas solicitudes de funciones","Ayudar a los desarrolladores junior con orientación para la implementación","Crear especificaciones técnicas detalladas para el desarrollo de productos"],"fr":["Générer des PRD pour de nouvelles demandes de fonctionnalités","Aider les développeurs junior avec des conseils pour la mise en œuvre","Créer des spécifications techniques détaillées pour le développement de produits"],"de":["Erstellen von PRD für neue Funktionsanforderungen","Unterstützung von junior-Entwicklern bei der Implementierungsanleitung","Erstellung detaillierter technischer Spezifikationen für die Produktentwicklung"],"pt":["Gerar PRDs para novos pedidos de recursos","Auxiliar desenvolvedores juniors com orientação de implementação","Criar especificações técnicas detalhadas para desenvolvimento de produtos"],"ru":["Генерировать PRD для новых запросов функций","Помогать младшим разработчикам с помощью руководства по реализации","Создавать подробные технические спецификации для разработки продукта"],"ar":["إنشاء مستندات متطلبات المنتج (PRD) لطلبات الميزات الجديدة","مساعدة المطورين الجدد بتوجيه التنفيذ","إنشاء مواصفات تقنية مفصلة لتطوير المنتج"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires initial user prompt for PRD generation","Supports Markdown format only","Limited to guiding junior developers"],"zh":["需要初始用户提示来生成PRD","仅支持Markdown格式","仅限于指导初级开发人员"],"ja":["PRD生成のために初期ユーザープロンプトが必要","Markdown形式のみをサポート","初級開発者へのガイダンスのみ"],"ko":["PRD 생성을 위해 초기 사용자 프롬프트가 필요","Markdown 형식만 지원","초급 개발자에게만 지침 제공"],"es":["Requiere una llamada de usuario inicial para la generación de PRD","Solo admite el formato Markdown","Limitado a guiar a los desarrolladores junior"],"fr":["Nécessite un appel utilisateur initial pour la génération de PRD","Ne prend en charge que le format Markdown","Limité à guider les développeurs junior"],"de":["Benötigt einen anfänglichen Benutzereingriff für die PRD-Generierung","Unterstützt nur das Markdown-Format","Eingeschränkt auf die Unterstützung von junior-Entwicklern"],"pt":["Exige um prompt inicial do usuário para geração de PRD","Suporta apenas o formato Markdown","Limitado a orientar desenvolvedores juniors"],"ru":["Требует начального запроса пользователя для генерации PRD","Поддерживает только формат Markdown","Ограничен руководством для младших разработчиков"],"ar":["يتطلب إشارة مستخدم أولية لإنشاء مستند متطلبات المنتج (PRD)","يدعم تنسيق Markdown فقط","محدود لتوجيه المطورين الجدد"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"c0799587f13a9a53931a392da87318ddbe3c0bd75a71dff3c7d17e2d063ec6f0","qualityScore":57}');
