-writer es una herramienta de inteligencia artificial que asiste en la investigación y escritura de contenido técnico","fr":"Le content-research-writer est un outil d''intelligence artificielle qui aide à la recherche et à l''écriture de contenu technique","de":"Der content-research-writer ist ein KI-Tool, das bei der Recherche und dem Schreiben von technischem Inhalt hilft","pt":"O Content Research Writer é uma ferramenta de inteligência artificial que ajuda a criar conteúdo de alta qualidade","ru":"ИИ Агент Content Research Writer - это инструмент искусственного интеллекта, помогающий создавать высококачественный контент","ar":"كتّاب البحث المحتوى هو أداة ذكاء اصطناعي تساعد في إنشاء المحتوى ذي الجودة العالية"},"features":{"en":["Researches and writes case studies with accurate citations","Drafts thought leadership pieces with a unique voice and style","Produces technical documentation with sources and references","Improves hooks and introductions for engaging content","Writes blog posts, articles, and newsletters with AI assistance"],"zh":["研究和引用支持","文章和博客的自动提纲","技术文档的生成","案例研究的撰写","hook和介绍的改进"],"ja":["研究と引用のサポート","記事とブログの自動アウトライン","テクニカルドキュメントの生成","ケーススタディの作成","hookと紹介の改善"],"ko":["연구와 인용 지원","기사와 블로그의 자동 아웃라인","기술문서의 생성","사례연구의 작성","hook과 소개의 개선"],"es":["Investigación y escritura de artículos y publicaciones","Creación de contenido educativo y tutoriales","Redacción de artículos de liderazgo y estudios de caso","Generación de documentación técnica con fuentes y citas","Mejora de títulos y introducciones","Integración con herramientas de escritura y edición"],"fr":["Recherche et écriture d''articles et de publications","Création de contenu éducatif et de tutoriels","Rédaction d''articles de liderazgo et d''études de cas","Génération de documentation technique avec sources et citations","Amélioration de titres et d''introductions","Intégration avec des outils d''écriture et d''édition"],"de":["Recherche und Schreiben von Artikeln und Veröffentlichungen","Erstellung von Bildungsinhalten und Tutorien","Verfassen von Führungskraftartikeln und Fallstudien","Erzeugung von technischer Dokumentation mit Quellen und Zitaten","Verbesserung von Titeln und Einleitungen","Integration mit Schreib- und Editierwerkzeugen"],"pt":["Pesquisa e citação automática","Criação de esboços e rascunhos","Melhoria de hooks e introduções","Suporte à criação de conteúdo educacional e tutoriais","Produção de documentação técnica com fontes","Manutenção do estilo único do autor"],"ru":["Автоматический поиск и цитирование","Создание эскизов и черновиков","Улучшение хуков и интро","Поддержка создания образовательного контента и туториалов","Производство технической документации с источниками","Сохранение уникального стиля автора"],"ar":["البحث والاستشهاد الآلي","إنشاء المخططات والمسودات","تحسين Hooks والمداخل","دعم إنشاء المحتوى التعليمي والتعليمات","إنتاج الوثائق الفنية مع المصادر","الحفاظ على الأسلوب الفريد للمؤلف"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use content-research-writer","content-research-writer alternative","content-research-writer setup guide","what is content-research-writer","content-research-writer vs writing assistants","install content-research-writer","content-research-writer for technical documentation","content-research-writer for blog posts","content-research-writer tutorial"],"zh":["内容研究写作工具","AI工具","写作伙伴","技术文档","案例研究","引用支持","自动提纲","开发者工具"],"ja":["コンテンツ研究ライター","AIエージェント","ライティングパートナー","テクニカルドキュメント","ケーススタディ","引用サポート","自動アウトライン","開発者ツール"],"ko":["콘텐츠 연구 작가","AI 도구","라이팅 파트너","기술문서","사례연구","인용 지원","自动 아웃라인","개발자 도구"],"es":["content-research-writer","herramientas de escritura técnica","investigación y citación","creación de contenido","desarrollo de software","documentación técnica","artículos de liderazgo","estudios de caso","tutoriales y educación"],"fr":["content-research-writer","outils d''écriture technique","recherche et citation","création de contenu","développement de logiciels","documentation technique","articles de liderazgo","études de cas","tutoriels et éducation"],"de":["content-research-writer","Werkzeuge für technisches Schreiben","Recherche und Zitierung","Erstellung von Inhalten","Softwareentwicklung","technische Dokumentation","Führungskraftartikel","Fallstudien","Tutorien und Bildung"],"pt":["Content Research Writer","ferramenta de criação de conteúdo","inteligência artificial","pesquisa automática","citação automática","criação de conteúdo educacional","produção de documentação técnica","desenvolvedores de conteúdo"],"ru":["ИИ Агент Content Research Writer","инструмент создания контента","искусственный интеллект","автоматический поиск","автоматическое цитирование","создание образовательного контента","производство технической документации","разработчики контента"],"ar":["كتّاب البحث المحتوى","أداة إنشاء المحتوى","ذكاء اصطناعي","البحث الآلي","الاستشهاد الآلي","إنشاء المحتوى التعليمي","إنتاج الوثائق الفنية","مطورو المحتوى"]}},"owner":"boomNDS","repo":"new_portfolio","repoPath":"boomNDS/new_portfolio","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.331Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"content-research-writer","description":"Assists in writing high-quality content by conducting research, adding citations, improving hooks, iterating on outlines, and providing real-time feedback on each section. Transforms your writing process from solo effort to collaborative partnership.","bodyPreview":"# Content Research Writer\n\nThis skill acts as your writing partner, helping you research, outline, draft, and refine content while maintaining your unique voice and style.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Writing blog posts, articles, or newsletters\n- Creating educational content or tutorials\n- Drafting thought leadership pieces\n- Researching and writing case studies\n- Producing technical documentation with sources\n- Writing with proper citations and references\n- Improving hooks and introductions\n-","body":"# Content Research Writer\n\nThis skill acts as your writing partner, helping you research, outline, draft, and refine content while maintaining your unique voice and style.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Writing blog posts, articles, or newsletters\n- Creating educational content or tutorials\n- Drafting thought leadership pieces\n- Researching and writing case studies\n- Producing technical documentation with sources\n- Writing with proper citations and references\n- Improving hooks and introductions\n- Getting section-by-section feedback while writing\n\n## What This Skill Does\n\n1. **Collaborative Outlining**: Helps you structure ideas into coherent outlines\n2. **Research Assistance**: Finds relevant information and adds citations\n3. **Hook Improvement**: Strengthens your opening to capture attention\n4. **Section Feedback**: Reviews each section as you write\n5. **Voice Preservation**: Maintains your writing style and tone\n6. **Citation Management**: Adds and formats references properly\n7. **Iterative Refinement**: Helps you improve through multiple drafts\n\n## How to Use\n\n### Setup Your Writing Environment\n\nCreate a dedicated folder for your article:\n```\nmkdir ~/writing/my-article-title\ncd ~/writing/my-article-title\n```\n\nCreate your draft file:\n```\ntouch article-draft.md\n```\n\nOpen Claude Code from this directory and start writing.\n\n### Basic Workflow\n\n1. **Start with an outline**:\n```\nHelp me create an outline for an article about [topic]\n```\n\n2. **Research and add citations**:\n```\nResearch [specific topic] and add citations to my outline\n```\n\n3. **Improve the hook**:\n```\nHere''s my introduction. Help me make the hook more compelling.\n```\n\n4. **Get section feedback**:\n```\nI just finished the \"Why This Matters\" section. Review it and give feedback.\n```\n\n5. **Refine and polish**:\n```\nReview the full draft for flow, clarity, and consistency.\n```\n\n## Instructions\n\nWhen a user requests writing assistance:\n\n1. **Understand the Writing Project**\n   \n   Ask clarifying questions:\n   - What''s the topic and main argument?\n   - Who''s the target audience?\n   - What''s the desired length/format?\n   - What''s your goal? (educate, persuade, entertain, explain)\n   - Any existing research or sources to include?\n   - What''s your writing style? (formal, conversational, technical)\n\n2. **Collaborative Outlining**\n   \n   Help structure the content:\n   \n   ```markdown\n   # Article Outline: [Title]\n   \n   ## Hook\n   - [Opening line/story/statistic]\n   - [Why reader should care]\n   \n   ## Introduction\n   - Context and background\n   - Problem statement\n   - What this article covers\n   \n   ## Main Sections\n   \n   ### Section 1: [Title]\n   - Key point A\n   - Key point B\n   - Example/evidence\n   - [Research needed: specific topic]\n   \n   ### Section 2: [Title]\n   - Key point C\n   - Key point D\n   - Data/citation needed\n   \n   ### Section 3: [Title]\n   - Key point E\n   - Counter-arguments\n   - Resolution\n   \n   ## Conclusion\n   - Summary of main points\n   - Call to action\n   - Final thought\n   \n   ## Research To-Do\n   - [ ] Find data on [topic]\n   - [ ] Get examples of [concept]\n   - [ ] Source citation for [claim]\n   ```\n   \n   **Iterate on outline**:\n   - Adjust based on feedback\n   - Ensure logical flow\n   - Identify research gaps\n   - Mark sections for deep dives\n\n3. **Conduct Research**\n   \n   When user requests research on a topic:\n   \n   - Search for relevant information\n   - Find credible sources\n   - Extract key facts, quotes, and data\n   - Add citations in requested format\n   \n   Example output:\n   ```markdown\n   ## Research: AI Impact on Productivity\n   \n   Key Findings:\n   \n   1. **Productivity Gains**: Studies show 40% time savings for \n      content creation tasks [1]\n   \n   2. **Adoption Rates**: 67% of knowledge workers use AI tools \n      weekly [2]\n   \n   3. **Expert Quote**: \"AI augments rather than replaces human \n      creativity\" - Dr. Jane Smith, MIT [3]\n   \n   Citations:\n   [1] McKinsey Global Institute. (2024). \"The Economic Potential \n       of Generative AI\"\n   [2] Stack Overflow Developer Survey (2024)\n   [3] Smith, J. (2024). MIT Technology Review interview\n   \n   Added to outline under Section 2.\n   ```\n\n4. **Improve Hooks**\n   \n   When user shares an introduction, analyze and strengthen:\n   \n   **Current Hook Analysis**:\n   - What works: [positive elements]\n   - What could be stronger: [areas for improvement]\n   - Emotional impact: [current vs. potential]\n   \n   **Suggested Alternatives**:\n   \n   Option 1: [Bold statement]\n   > [Example]\n   *Why it works: [explanation]*\n   \n   Option 2: [Personal story]\n   > [Example]\n   *Why it works: [explanation]*\n   \n   Option 3: [Surprising data]\n   > [Example]\n   *Why it works: [explanation]*\n   \n   **Questions to hook**:\n   - Does it create curiosity?\n   - Does it promise value?\n   - Is it specific enough?\n   - Does it match the audience?\n\n5. **Provide Section-by-Section Feedback**\n   \n   As user writes each section, review for:\n   \n   ```markdown\n   # Feedback: [Section Name]\n   \n   ## What Works Well ✓\n   - [Strength 1]\n   - [Strength 2]\n   - [Strength 3]\n   \n   ## Suggestions for Improvement\n   \n   ### Clarity\n   - [Specific issue] → [Suggested fix]\n   - [Complex sentence] → [Simpler alternative]\n   \n   ### Flow\n   - [Transition issue] → [Better connection]\n   - [Paragraph order] → [Suggested reordering]\n   \n   ### Evidence\n   - [Claim needing support] → [Add citation or example]\n   - [Generic statement] → [Make more specific]\n   \n   ### Style\n   - [Tone inconsistency] → [Match your voice better]\n   - [Word choice] → [Stronger alternative]\n   \n   ## Specific Line Edits\n   \n   Original:\n   > [Exact quote from draft]\n   \n   Suggested:\n   > [Improved version]\n   \n   Why: [Explanation]\n   \n   ## Questions to Consider\n   - [Thought-provoking question 1]\n   - [Thought-provoking question 2]\n   \n   Ready to move to next section!\n   ```\n\n6. **Preserve Writer''s Voice**\n   \n   Important principles:\n   \n   - **Learn their style**: Read existing writing samples\n   - **Suggest, don''t replace**: Offer options, not directives\n   - **Match tone**: Formal, casual, technical, friendly\n   - **Respect choices**: If they prefer their version, support it\n   - **Enhance, don''t override**: Make their writing better, not different\n   \n   Ask periodically:\n   - \"Does this sound like you?\"\n   - \"Is this the right tone?\"\n   - \"Should I be more/less [formal/casual/technical]?\"\n\n7. **Citation Management**\n   \n   Handle references based on user preference:\n   \n   **Inline Citations**:\n   ```markdown\n   Studies show 40% productivity improvement (McKinsey, 2024).\n   ```\n   \n   **Numbered References**:\n   ```markdown\n   Studies show 40% productivity improvement [1].\n   \n   [1] McKinsey Global Institute. (2024)...\n   ```\n   \n   **Footnote Style**:\n   ```markdown\n   Studies show 40% productivity improvement^1\n   \n   ^1: McKinsey Global Institute. (2024)...\n   ```\n   \n   Maintain a running citations list:\n   ```markdown\n   ## References\n   \n   1. Author. (Year). \"Title\". Publication.\n   2. Author. (Year). \"Title\". Publication.\n   ...\n   ```\n\n8. **Final Review and Polish**\n   \n   When draft is complete, provide comprehensive feedback:\n   \n   ```markdown\n   # Full Draft Review\n   \n   ## Overall Assessment\n   \n   **Strengths**:\n   - [Major strength 1]\n   - [Major strength 2]\n   - [Major strength 3]\n   \n   **Impact**: [Overall effectiveness assessment]\n   \n   ## Structure & Flow\n   - [Comments on organization]\n   - [Transition quality]\n   - [Pacing assessment]\n   \n   ## Content Quality\n   - [Argument strength]\n   - [Evidence sufficiency]\n   - [Example effectiveness]\n   \n   ## Technical Quality\n   - Grammar and mechanics: [assessment]\n   - Consistency: [assessment]\n   - Citations: [completeness check]\n   \n   ## Readability\n   - Clarity score: [evaluation]\n   - Sentence variety: [evaluation]\n   - Paragraph length: [evaluation]\n   \n   ## Final Polish Suggestions\n   \n   1. **Introduction**: [Specific improvements]\n   2. **Body**: [Specific improvements]\n   3. **Conclusion**: [Specific improvements]\n   4. **Title**: [Options if needed]\n   \n   ## Pre-Publish Checklist\n   - [ ] All claims sourced\n   - [ ] Citations formatted\n   - [ ] Examples clear\n   - [ ] Transitions smooth\n   - [ ] Call to action present\n   - [ ] Proofread for typos\n   \n   Ready to publish! 🚀\n   ```\n\n## Examples\n\n### Example 1: Teresa Torres''s Workflow\n\n**User**: \"I''m writing an article about continuous discovery. Help me create an outline.\"\n\n**Process**:\n1. Collaborates on outline structure\n2. Identifies research needs\n3. User starts writing introduction\n4. Reviews and improves the hook\n5. User writes each section\n6. Provides feedback after each section\n7. Conducts research and adds citations\n8. Final review of complete draft\n9. Polish and prep for publishing\n\n**Result**: Well-researched, properly cited article written in Teresa''s voice with strong structure and flow.\n\n### Example 2: Research-Heavy Article\n\n**User**: \"I''m writing about AI''s impact on product management. Help me find current data and examples.\"\n\n**Output**:\n```markdown\n## Research Compiled\n\n### Recent Data\n- Gartner: 80% of PMs will use AI tools by 2025 [1]\n- Survey: 45% report faster feature shipping [2]\n- Case study: Airbnb''s AI-assisted prioritization [3]\n\n### Expert Quotes\n- \"AI amplifies PM judgment, not replaces it\" - Marty Cagan\n- [Additional quotes with citations]\n\n### Real Examples\n1. **Company A**: Used AI for user research synthesis\n   - Result: 60% time savings\n   - Source: [citation]\n\n2. **Company B**: AI-powered roadmap analysis\n   - Result: Better stakeholder alignment\n   - Source: [citation]\n\nAll added to your outline with proper citations.\n```\n\n### Example 3: Hook Improvement\n\n**User''s Original Hook**:\n> \"Product management is changing because of AI. In this article, I''ll discuss some ways AI affects product managers.\"\n\n**Improved Options**:\n\n**Option 1 (Data-driven)**:\n> \"Last month, I asked AI to analyze 500 customer interviews. It took 30 minutes instead of 3 weeks. Product management will never be the same.\"\n\n**Option 2 (Question)**:\n> \"What if you could talk to every customer, read every review, and analyze every support ticket—all before your morning coffee?\"\n\n**Option 3 (Story)**:\n> \"Sarah spent two weeks building the wrong feature. Not because she didn''t understand her users, but because she couldn''t process the hundreds of interviews fast enough to spot the pattern.\"\n\n### Example 4: Section Feedback\n\n**User**: \"Just finished my ''Common Mistakes'' section. Thoughts?\"\n\n**Response**:\n```markdown\n# Feedback: Common Mistakes Section\n\n## What Works Well ✓\n- Strong examples (the Slack notification story)\n- Clear structure (3 mistakes, clean layout)\n- Practical advice for each mistake\n\n## Suggestions\n\n### Make It More Specific\nYour second point says \"Bad prioritization\" but could be stronger:\n\nCurrent:\n> \"Many teams prioritize badly by focusing on features instead of outcomes.\"\n\nSuggested:\n> \"I''ve watched teams ship 14 features in a quarter yet move none of their key metrics. They prioritized activity over progress.\"\n\n### Add Data\nThe third mistake would benefit from evidence:\n> \"[Add citation]: Studies show teams without regular user contact are 3x more likely to build unused features [needs source]\"\n\n### Flow Improvement\nConsider reordering: Mistake 3 → Mistake 2 → Mistake 1\nThis builds from small to big impact.\n\nReady for the next section!\n```\n\n## Writing Workflows\n\n### Blog Post Workflow\n1. Outline together\n2. Research key points\n3. Write introduction → get feedback\n4. Write body sections → feedback each\n5. Write conclusion → final review\n6. Polish and edit\n\n### Newsletter Workflow\n1. Discuss hook ideas\n2. Quick outline (shorter format)\n3. Draft in one session\n4. Review for clarity and links\n5. Quick polish\n\n### Technical Tutorial Workflow\n1. Outline steps\n2. Write code examples\n3. Add explanations\n4. Test instructions\n5. Add troubleshooting section\n6. Final review for accuracy\n\n### Thought Leadership Workflow\n1. Brainstorm unique angle\n2. Research existing perspectives\n3. Develop your thesis\n4. Write with strong POV\n5. Add supporting evidence\n6. Craft compelling conclusion\n\n## Pro Tips\n\n1. **Work in VS Code**: Better than web Claude for long-form writing\n2. **One section at a time**: Get feedback incrementally\n3. **Save research separately**: Keep a research.md file\n4. **Version your drafts**: article-v1.md, article-v2.md, etc.\n5. **Read aloud**: Use feedback to identify clunky sentences\n6. **Set deadlines**: \"I want to finish the draft today\"\n7. **Take breaks**: Write, get feedback, pause, revise\n\n## File Organization\n\nRecommended structure for writing projects:\n\n```\n~/writing/article-name/\n├── outline.md          # Your outline\n├── research.md         # All research and citations\n├── draft-v1.md         # First draft\n├── draft-v2.md         # Revised draft\n├── final.md            # Publication-ready\n├── feedback.md         # Collected feedback\n└── sources/            # Reference materials\n    ├── study1.pdf\n    └── article2.md\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### For Research\n- Verify sources before citing\n- Use recent data when possible\n- Balance different perspectives\n- Link to original sources\n\n### For Feedback\n- Be specific about what you want: \"Is this too technical?\"\n- Share your concerns: \"I''m worried this section drags\"\n- Ask questions: \"Does this flow logically?\"\n- Request alternatives: \"What''s another way to explain this?\"\n\n### For Voice\n- Share examples of your writing\n- Specify tone preferences\n- Point out good matches: \"That sounds like me!\"\n- Flag mismatches: \"Too formal for my style\"\n\n## Related Use Cases\n\n- Creating social media posts from articles\n- Adapting content for different audiences\n- Writing email newsletters\n- Drafting technical documentation\n- Creating presentation content\n- Writing case studies\n- Developing course outlines\n\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:03:13.029Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Language Agents like Claude Code, AutoGPT, or LangChain needing high-quality, uniquely styled content generation capabilities.","zh":"适用于 Claude Code、AutoGPT 或 LangChain 等语言代理，需要高质量、独特风格的内容生成能力。","ja":"Claude Code、AutoGPT、LangChain などの言語エージェントに適しており、高品質でユニークなスタイルのコンテンツ生成機能が必要です。","ko":"Claude Code, AutoGPT, LangChain 등의 언어 에이전트에 적합하며, 고품질의 고유한 스타일의 콘텐츠 생성 기능이 필요합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Lenguaje como Claude Code, AutoGPT o LangChain que necesitan capacidades de generación de contenido de alta calidad y estilo único.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de langage comme Claude Code, AutoGPT ou LangChain nécessitant des capacités de génération de contenu de haute qualité et de style unique.","de":"Ideal für Sprachagenten wie Claude Code, AutoGPT oder LangChain, die hochwertige, einzigartig gestaltete Inhaltsgenerierungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agents de Linguagem como Claude Code, AutoGPT ou LangChain que necessitam de capacidades de geração de conteúdo de alta qualidade e estilo único.","ru":"Идеально для языковых агентов, таких как Claude Code, AutoGPT или LangChain, которые требуют возможностей генерации контента высокого качества и уникального стиля.","ar":"مثالي لعميل اللغة مثل Claude Code و AutoGPT أو LangChain الذي يحتاج إلى قدرات توليد المحتوى عالي الجودة والأسلوب الفريد."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to research and draft engaging blog posts, articles, and technical documentation with proper citations and references, utilizing advanced natural language processing to maintain a unique voice and style, and supporting formats like markdown and HTML.","zh":"赋予代理能力，利用高级自然语言处理来维持独特的声音和风格，支持像 markdown 和 HTML 这样的格式，研究和撰写引人入胜的博客文章、文章和技术文档，并附有适当的引用和参考。","ja":"エージェントに研究と下書きを行う力を与え、高度な自然言語処理を使用してユニークな声とスタイルを維持し、markdown や HTML などの形式をサポートし、適切な引用と参考文献を付けた魅力的なブログ記事、記事、技術文書を生成します。","ko":"에이전트에 연구와 초안을 작성할 수 있는 능력을 부여하고, 고급 자연어 처리를 사용하여 고유한 목소리와 스타일을 유지하며, markdown 또는 HTML 같은 형식을 지원하여, 적절한 인용과 참조를 포함한 매력적인 블로그 게시물, 기사, 기술 문서를 생성합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes investigar y redactar publicaciones de blog, artículos y documentación técnica con citas y referencias adecuadas, utilizando un procesamiento avanzado de lenguaje natural para mantener una voz y un estilo únicos, y admitiendo formatos como markdown y HTML.","fr":"Permet aux agents de recherche et de rédiger des articles de blog, des articles et de la documentation technique avec des citations et des références appropriées, en utilisant un traitement avancé du langage naturel pour maintenir une voix et un style uniques, et en prenant en charge des formats tels que markdown et HTML.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Recherchen durchzuführen und engagierte Blog-Beiträge, Artikel und technische Dokumentationen mit ordnungsgemäßen Zitaten und Quellenangaben zu erstellen, indem sie fortschrittliche Verfahren der natürlichen Sprachverarbeitung nutzen, um eine einzigartige Stimme und einen einzigartigen Stil beizubehalten und Formate wie markdown und HTML zu unterstützen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a pesquisar e criar posts de blog, artigos e documentação técnica atraentes com citações e referências apropriadas, utilizando processamento avançado de linguagem natural para manter uma voz e estilo únicos, e suportando formatos como markdown e HTML.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью исследовать и создавать привлекательные блог-посты, статьи и техническую документацию с правильными цитатами и ссылками, используя продвинутую обработку естественного языка для поддержания уникального голоса и стиля, и поддерживая форматы, такие как markdown и HTML.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من البحث والتحضير لمقالات مدونة ومقالات ووثائق فنية جذابة مع اقتباسات ومراجع مناسبة، باستخدام معالجة متقدمة للغة الطبيعية للحفاظ على صوت وأسلوب فريد، ودعم صيغ مثل markdown و HTML."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating research for thought leadership pieces","Generating educational content with accurate citations","Drafting technical documentation with integrated source references"],"zh":["自动化研究以创建思想领导力文章","生成带有准确引用和参考的教育内容","创建带有集成源引用的技术文档"],"ja":["リーダーシップ記事の研究を自動化する","正確な引用と参考文献を含む教育コンテンツを生成する","統合ソースの参照を含む技術文書を下書きする"],"ko":["리더십 기사의 연구를 자동화하는 것","정확한 인용과 참조를 포함한 교육 콘텐츠를 생성하는 것","통합 소스의 참조를 포함한 기술 문서 초안을 작성하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar la investigación para artículos de liderazgo de pensamiento","Generar contenido educativo con citas precisas","Redactar documentación técnica con referencias de fuente integradas"],"fr":["Automatiser la recherche pour les articles de leadership de pensée","Générer du contenu éducatif avec des citations précises","Rédiger de la documentation technique avec des références de source intégrées"],"de":["Forschung für Denkführungsartikel zu automatisieren","Bildungsinhalte mit genauen Zitaten zu generieren","Technische Dokumentationen mit integrierten Quellenangaben zu erstellen"],"pt":["Automatizar a pesquisa para artigos de liderança de pensamento","Gerar conteúdo educacional com citações precisas","Criar documentação técnica com referências de fonte integradas"],"ru":["Автоматизировать исследования для статей лидерства мысли","Генерировать образовательный контент с точными цитатами","Создавать техническую документацию с интегрированными источниками"],"ar":["أتمتة البحث لقطع التوجيه الفكري","توليد المحتوى التعليمي مع اقتباسات دقيقة","إنشاء وثائق فنية مع مراجع مصدر متكاملة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to external knowledge sources","May need human oversight for fact-checking and validation","Style and tone customization may require additional training data"],"zh":["需要访问外部知识来源","可能需要人类的监督来进行事实检查和验证","样式和语气的自定义可能需要额外的训练数据"],"ja":["外部知識源へのアクセスが必要","事実の検証とバリデーションのためには人間の監視が必要になる場合がある","スタイルとトーンのカスタマイズには追加のトレーニングデータが必要になる場合がある"],"ko":["외부 지식 소스에 대한 액세스가 필요","사실 확인 및 검증을 위해 인간의 감시가 필요할 수 있음","스타イル 및 톤의 사용자 지정에는 추가적인 훈련 데이터가 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere acceso a fuentes de conocimiento externas","Puede necesitar supervisión humana para la verificación y validación de hechos","La personalización del estilo y el tono puede requerir datos de entrenamiento adicionales"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à des sources de connaissances externes","Peut nécessiter une surveillance humaine pour la vérification et la validation des faits","La personnalisation du style et du ton peut nécessiter des données de formation supplémentaires"],"de":["Erfordert den Zugriff auf externe Wissensquellen","Kann menschliche Überwachung für die Überprüfung und Validierung von Fakten erfordern","Die Anpassung von Stil und Ton kann zusätzliche Trainingsdaten erfordern"],"pt":["Requer acesso a fontes de conhecimento externas","Pode precisar de supervisão humana para verificação e validação de fatos","Customização de estilo e tom pode requerer dados de treinamento adicionais"],"ru":["Требует доступа к внешним источникам знаний","Может потребовать человеческого надзора для проверки и подтверждения фактов","Настройка стиля и тона может потребовать дополнительных данных для обучения"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى مصادر المعرفة الخارجية","قد يحتاج إلى إشراف بشري للتحقق والتحقق من الحقائق","تخصيص الأسلوب واللحن قد يتطلب بيانات تدريب إضافية"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"1e2e8681cf7ba31550ac69151ec3fcb427559bcd3a92dc5e3b7070b7f4e076d3","qualityScore":57}');
