st un outil de développement qui permet l''interaction avec la plateforme d''évaluation de Taiga","de":"Die Taiga-API ist ein Entwicklungstool, das die Interaktion mit der Taiga-Bewertungsplattform ermöglicht","pt":"O Taiga API é uma plataforma de avaliação hospedada que fornece resultados de trabalho, transcrições e execuções de problemas","ru":"Taiga API - это хостинговая платформа оценки, которая предоставляет результаты работы, транскрипции и выполнения задач","ar":"Taiga API هو منصة تقييم محتواة توفر نتائج الوظائف والمحاكاة وتنفيذ المشكلات"},"features":{"en":["Queries the hosted Taiga evaluation platform API using Python","Loads cookies from a .env file using a Python helper function","Retrieves job results, transcripts, and problem runs from the Taiga API","Avoids shell env var and pipe bugs that strip cookie values","Utilizes a Python-based approach for reliable API requests"],"zh":["使用 Python 加载 cookie","查询 job 结果","支持 Taiga 评估平台 API","自动化工作流程","提高开发效率"],"ja":["Python を使用して Cookie をロード","ジョブ結果を照会","Taiga 評価プラットフォーム API をサポート","ワークフローを自動化","開発効率を向上"],"ko":["Python을 사용하여 쿠키 로드","작업 결과 쿼리","Taiga 평가 플랫폼 API 지원","자동화된 워크플로","개발 효율성 향상"],"es":["Acceso a resultados de trabajos y transcripciones","Ejecución de problemas y recuperación de resultados","Uso de Python para realizar solicitudes a la API","Carga de cookies con el helper de Python","Integración con la plataforma de evaluación de Taiga"],"fr":["Accès aux résultats de tâches et transcriptions","Exécution de problèmes et récupération de résultats","Utilisation de Python pour effectuer des requêtes à l''API","Chargement de cookies avec l''helper Python","Intégration avec la plateforme d''évaluation de Taiga"],"de":["Zugriff auf Auftrags Ergebnisse und Transkriptionen","Ausführung von Problemen und Abruf von Ergebnissen","Verwendung von Python für API-Anfragen","Laden von Cookies mit dem Python-Helper","Integration mit der Taiga-Bewertungsplattform"],"pt":["Suporte a consultas de resultados de trabalho com Python","Acesso a transcrições e execuções de problemas","Uso de cookies para autenticação","Função de carregamento de cookies com Python"],"ru":["Поддержка запросов результатов работы с помощью Python","Доступ к транскрипциям и выполнению задач","Использование cookie для аутентификации","Функция загрузки cookie с помощью Python"],"ar":["دعم استعلام نتائج الوظائف باستخدام Python","الوصول إلى المحاكاة وتنفيذ المشكلات","استخدام الكعكات لتحقق الهوية","وظيفة تحميل الكعكات باستخدام Python"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use taiga-api","taiga-api python setup","taiga-api alternative","taiga-api vs other APIs","taiga-api install guide","taiga-api setup tutorial","what is taiga-api","taiga-api documentation","taiga-api query examples"],"zh":["Taiga API","Python","自动化","Cookie","Taiga 评估平台","API 集成","开发效率","工作流程自动化"],"ja":["Taiga API","Python","自動化","Cookie","Taiga 評価プラットフォーム","API 統合","開発効率","ワークフロー自動化"],"ko":["Taiga API","Python","자동화","쿠키","Taiga 평가 플랫폼","API 통합","개발 효율성","자동화된 워크플로"],"es":["Taiga API","desarrollo de API","Python para API","herramientas de desarrollo","plataforma de evaluación","acceso a resultados de trabajos","transcripciones de audio","ejecución de problemas"],"fr":["API Taiga","développement d''API","Python pour API","outils de développement","plateforme d''évaluation","accès aux résultats de tâches","transcriptions de l''audio","exécution de problèmes"],"de":["Taiga-API","API-Entwicklung","Python für API","Entwicklungstools","Bewertungsplattform","Zugriff auf Auftrags Ergebnisse","Audio-Transkriptionen","Problem-Ausführung"],"pt":["Taiga API","Python","resultado de trabalho","transcrição","execução de problemas","autenticação com cookies","desenvolvimento de API","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Taiga API","Python","результат работы","транскрипция","выполнение задач","аутентификация с помощью cookie","разработка API","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["Taiga API","Python","نتائج الوظائف","المحاكاة","تنفيذ المشكلات","تحقق الهوية بالكعكات","تطوير واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"atondwal","repo":"config","repoPath":"atondwal/config","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.344Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"taiga-api","description":"Query the hosted Taiga API at taiga.ant.dev for job results, passrates, transcripts, and run evaluations. Use when user asks about Taiga jobs, problem scores, eval results, or needs to submit/check jobs.","bodyPreview":"# Taiga API\n\nQuery the hosted Taiga evaluation platform API for job results, transcripts, and problem runs.\n\n## IMPORTANT: Use Python, Not Shell\n\n**Always use Python for Taiga API requests.** Shell has env var + pipe bugs that strip cookie values.\n\nPython helper to load cookie:\n```python\ndef get_cookie():\n    with open(''/home/atondwal/dmodel/ant/taiga-worktree/.env'') as f:\n        for line in f:\n            if line.startswith(''TAIGA_IAP_COOKIE=''):\n                return line.split(''='', 1)[1].str","body":"# Taiga API\n\nQuery the hosted Taiga evaluation platform API for job results, transcripts, and problem runs.\n\n## IMPORTANT: Use Python, Not Shell\n\n**Always use Python for Taiga API requests.** Shell has env var + pipe bugs that strip cookie values.\n\nPython helper to load cookie:\n```python\ndef get_cookie():\n    with open(''/home/atondwal/dmodel/ant/taiga-worktree/.env'') as f:\n        for line in f:\n            if line.startswith(''TAIGA_IAP_COOKIE=''):\n                return line.split(''='', 1)[1].strip().strip(''\"'')\n```\n\n## IMPORTANT: Always Use Opus 4.5\n\n**When submitting jobs, ALWAYS use `claude-opus-4-5-20251101` as the model. Never use Sonnet or other models unless explicitly requested.**\n\n## Authentication\n\nCookie stored in `~/dmodel/ant/taiga-worktree/.env`. Uses `__Host-` prefix (session-only). If auth fails, ask user to refresh from browser DevTools → Network → copy Cookie header.\n\n## Making Requests\n\n```python\nimport urllib.request, json\n\ndef taiga_get(endpoint):\n    cookie = get_cookie()  # see helper above\n    req = urllib.request.Request(f\"https://taiga.ant.dev/api{endpoint}\")\n    req.add_header(''Cookie'', cookie)\n    return json.loads(urllib.request.urlopen(req).read())\n\n# Example: get job problems\ndata = taiga_get(f\"/jobs/{job_id}/problems\")\n```\n\n## API Reference\n\nFull docs at: `https://taiga.ant.dev/api/docs`\n\n### Jobs (Most Common)\n\n| Endpoint | Method | Purpose |\n|----------|--------|---------|\n| `/jobs` | GET | List all jobs |\n| `/jobs?environment_id={id}` | GET | List jobs for environment |\n| `/jobs/{job_id}` | GET | Get job details |\n| `/jobs/{job_id}/problems` | GET | **Get problem results (passrates, scores)** |\n| `/jobs/{job_id}/problems/stream` | GET | Stream problem results |\n| `/jobs/{job_id}/error-summary` | GET | Get error summary |\n| `/jobs` | POST | Create job with problems |\n| `/cancel-job/{job_id}` | POST | Cancel running job |\n| `/resubmit-problem/{job_id}/{problem_id}` | POST | Resubmit specific problem |\n\n### Transcripts\n\n| Endpoint | Method | Purpose |\n|----------|--------|---------|\n| `/transcript/{problem_run_id}` | GET | Get full transcript |\n| `/transcript/stream/{problem_run_id}` | GET | Stream transcript |\n\n### Problem Runs\n\n| Endpoint | Method | Purpose |\n|----------|--------|---------|\n| `/problem_runs/{problem_id}` | GET | List runs for problem |\n| `/problem-runs/{id}/container-logs` | GET | Get container logs |\n| `/problem-runs/{id}/mcp-server-logs` | GET | Get MCP server logs |\n| `/problem-runs/{id}/download-output` | GET | Download output directory |\n\n### Environments\n\n| Endpoint | Method | Purpose |\n|----------|--------|---------|\n| `/environments` | GET | List environments |\n| `/environments/{id}` | GET | Get environment details |\n| `/environments?skip=0&limit=100` | GET | Paginated list |\n\n### Problems\n\n| Endpoint | Method | Purpose |\n|----------|--------|---------|\n| `/problems/{problem_id}/attempts` | GET | Get problem attempts |\n| `/problems/versions/{version_id}` | GET | Get problem version |\n| `/problems/versions/{version_id}/run` | POST | Run problem version |\n| `/problem-crud` | GET | List all problems |\n| `/problem-crud/stats/pass-rates` | POST | Get pass rate stats |\n\n### Docker Images\n\n| Endpoint | Method | Purpose |\n|----------|--------|---------|\n| `/docker-images` | GET | List docker images |\n| `/docker-images/{id}/download` | GET | Download image source |\n\n## Common Workflows\n\n### Get Passrates for a Job\n\n```python\njob_id = \"3c300cca-707a-4e92-ac71-5688165f9ae1\"  # from URL ?id= param\ndata = taiga_get(f\"/jobs/{job_id}/problems\")\nfor r in data:\n    print(f\"{r[''problem_id'']}: {r[''final_score'']}\")\n```\n\n### Aggregate Passrates\n\n```python\nfrom collections import defaultdict\n\njob_id = \"YOUR_JOB_ID\"\ndata = taiga_get(f\"/jobs/{job_id}/problems\")\n\nproblems = defaultdict(list)\nfor r in data:\n    problems[r[''problem_id'']].append(r[''final_score''])\n\ntotal_pass = total_runs = 0\nfor pid, scores in sorted(problems.items()):\n    passed = sum(1 for s in scores if s == 1.0)\n    total = len(scores)\n    total_pass += passed\n    total_runs += total\n    print(f\"{pid}: {passed}/{total} ({100*passed/total:.0f}%)\")\n\nprint(f\"\\nOverall: {total_pass}/{total_runs} ({100*total_pass/total_runs:.1f}%)\")\n```\n\n### Get Transcript\n\n```python\nproblem_run_id = \"118ed21a-9864-4c8c-b34b-d92428f1c22a\"\ntranscript = taiga_get(f\"/transcript/{problem_run_id}\")\n```\n\n### List Jobs for Environment\n\n```python\nenv_id = \"8e646c11-1461-44a4-9e8d-e3800a02ba07\"\njobs = taiga_get(f\"/jobs?environment_id={env_id}\")\nfor j in jobs:\n    print(f\"{j[''id'']}: {j[''status'']}\")\n```\n\n### Check Job Status\n\n```python\njob = taiga_get(f\"/jobs/{job_id}\")\nprint(f\"Status: {job[''status'']}, Completed: {job.get(''completed_count'')}\")\n```\n\n### Create a Job\n\n```python\nimport urllib.request, json\n\nwith open(''problems-metadata.json'') as f:\n    problems = json.load(f)\n\npayload = {\n    \"name\": \"my-job-name\",\n    \"problems_metadata\": problems,\n    \"n_attempts_per_problem\": 10,\n    \"api_model_name\": \"claude-opus-4-5-20251101\"  # ALWAYS use Opus 4.5\n}\n\ncookie = get_cookie()\nreq = urllib.request.Request(\n    \"https://taiga.ant.dev/api/jobs\",\n    data=json.dumps(payload).encode(),\n    headers={\"Cookie\": cookie, \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\"}\n)\nresp = json.loads(urllib.request.urlopen(req).read())\nprint(f\"Job ID: {resp.get(''job_id'')}\")\n```\n\n## Response Schemas\n\n### Problem Run\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"118ed21a-...\",\n  \"problem_id\": \"sort-unique\",\n  \"attempt_number\": 1,\n  \"final_score\": 1.0,\n  \"status\": \"completed\",\n  \"subscores\": {\"matched_solution\": 1.0},\n  \"weights\": {\"matched_solution\": 1.0},\n  \"execution_time_ms\": 467000,\n  \"total_tokens\": 34205\n}\n```\n\n### Job\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"3c300cca-...\",\n  \"status\": \"completed\",\n  \"environment_id\": \"8e646c11-...\",\n  \"api_model_name\": \"claude-opus-4-5-20251101\",\n  \"created_at\": \"2025-11-24T17:46:30Z\"\n}\n```\n\n## URL Patterns\n\nFrom Taiga web UI URLs:\n- Job page: `https://taiga.ant.dev/job?id={job_id}&environmentId={env_id}`\n- Transcripts: `https://taiga.ant.dev/transcripts?id={job_id}&problemId={problem_id}&...`\n\nThe `id` parameter in URLs is the job_id.\n\n## Tips\n\n1. Use Python with `urllib.request` - avoid shell due to env var bugs\n2. Cookie expires periodically - refresh from browser if auth fails\n3. `/jobs/{id}/problems` is the main endpoint for checking pass rates\n4. For streaming large responses, use the `/stream` variants\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:03:33.079Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Python-based AI Agents needing seamless integration with the Taiga evaluation platform API for job results and transcripts analysis.","zh":"适用于需要与Taiga评估平台API实现无缝集成以分析作业结果和转录的Python-based AI Agents。","ja":"Taiga評価プラットフォームAPIとのシームレスな統合が必要なPythonベースのAIエージェントに最適です。ジョブ結果とトランスクリプトの分析に使用されます。","ko":"Taiga 평가 플랫폼 API와의 무중단 통합이 필요한 Python 기반 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 작업 결과 및 전사本 분석에 사용됩니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA basados en Python que necesitan una integración perfecta con la plataforma de evaluación de Taiga API para el análisis de resultados de trabajo y transcripciones.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''IA basés sur Python nécessitant une intégration transparente avec la plateforme d''évaluation Taiga API pour l''analyse des résultats de travail et des transcriptions.","de":"Perfekt für Python-basierte KI-Agents, die eine nahtlose Integration mit der Taiga-Bewertungsplattform-API für die Analyse von Job-Ergebnissen und Transkripten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de IA baseados em Python que necessitam de integração perfeita com a plataforma de avaliação Taiga API para análise de resultados de trabalhos e transcritos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ на основе Python, которым необходима бесшовная интеграция с платформой оценки Taiga API для анализа результатов работы и транскриптов.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي التي تعتمد على بايثون التي تحتاج إلى دمج متكامل مع منصة تايجا لتقييم واي بي آي لنتائج الوظيفة وتحليل النصوص"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to query the Taiga API using Python, providing a helper function to load cookies and ensuring secure API requests, while leveraging the Taiga-API for job results, transcripts, and problem runs retrieval.","zh":"赋予代理使用Python查询Taiga API的能力，提供加载cookie的辅助函数，并确保安全的API请求，同时利用Taiga-API获取作业结果、转录和问题运行。","ja":"Pythonを使用してTaiga APIをクエリするエージェントの能力を提供し、Cookieをロードするヘルパー関数を提供し、セキュアなAPIリクエストを保証し、同時にTaiga-APIを使用してジョブ結果、トランスクリプト、問題実行を取得します。","ko":"에이전트가 Python을 사용하여 Taiga API를 쿼리할 수 있는 능력을 제공하고 쿠키를 로드하는 헬퍼 함수를 제공하며 보안 API 요청을 보장同时에 Taiga-API를 사용하여 작업 결과, 전사본 및 문제 실행을 가져옵니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a consultar la Taiga API utilizando Python, proporcionando una función de ayuda para cargar cookies y garantizando solicitudes de API seguras, al mismo tiempo que aprovecha la Taiga-API para la recuperación de resultados de trabajo, transcripciones y ejecuciones de problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''interroger l''API Taiga à l''aide de Python, en fournissant une fonction d''assistance pour charger les cookies et en garantissant des requêtes d''API sécurisées, tout en exploitant la Taiga-API pour la récupération des résultats de travail, des transcriptions et des exécutions de problèmes.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, die Taiga-API mit Python abzufragen, indem es eine Hilfsfunktion zur Laden von Cookies bereitstellt und sichere API-Anfragen gewährleistet, während es gleichzeitig die Taiga-API für die Abrufung von Job-Ergebnissen, Transkripten und Problem-Läufen nutzt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a consultar a Taiga API usando Python, fornecendo uma função auxiliar para carregar cookies e garantir solicitações de API seguras, aproveitando a Taiga-API para recuperação de resultados de trabalhos, transcritos e execuções de problemas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью запроса Taiga API с использованием Python, предоставляя функцию-помощник для загрузки файлов cookie и обеспечения безопасных запросов API, используя Taiga-API для получения результатов работы, транскриптов и запусков задач.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على استعلام واي بي آي تايجا باستخدام بايثون، مع تقديم وظيفة مساعدة لتحميل الكعكات وضمان طلبات واي بي آي الآمنة، مع الاستفادة من تايجا واي بي آي لاسترجاع نتائج الوظيفة والنصوص وتنفيذ المشاكل"},"useCases":{"en":["Querying job results from the Taiga evaluation platform","Retrieving transcripts and problem runs using the Taiga API","Automating Taiga API requests with Python"],"zh":["从Taiga评估平台查询作业结果","使用Taiga API检索转录和问题运行","使用Python自动化Taiga API请求"],"ja":["Taiga評価プラットフォームからジョブ結果をクエリする","Taiga APIを使用してトランスクリプトと問題実行を取得する","Pythonを使用してTaiga APIリクエストを自動化する"],"ko":["Taiga 평가 플랫폼에서 작업 결과를 쿼리する","Taiga API를 사용하여 전사본 및 문제 실행을 가져오는 것","Python을 사용하여 Taiga API 요청을 자동화하는 것"],"es":["C