fonctionnalités de formatage et d''édition avancées","de":"Tiptap Editor ist ein Markdown-Editor, der die ProseMirror-API verwendet, um erweiterte Formatierungs- und Bearbeitungsfunktionen anzubieten","pt":"O Tiptap Editor é um editor de markdown que fornece uma API de alto nível para formatar comandos e operações de bloco","ru":"Tiptap Editor — это редактор markdown, который предоставляет высокоуровневый API для форматирования команд и операций с блоками","ar":"محرر Tiptap هو محرر markdown يوفر واجهة برمجة تطبيقات من المستوى العلوي للتنسيق والأوامر"},"features":{"en":["Utilizes Tiptap''s high-level API for format commands (bold, italic, underline, etc.)","Supports block type changes (heading, paragraph, code block) via Tiptap API","Enables list operations (bullet, ordered, toggle, indent/outdent) through Tiptap API","Provides table operations via Tiptap table extension","Allows content insertion and manipulation using Tiptap API"],"zh":["高级 API 支持格式命令（粗体、斜体、下划线等）","支持块类型更改（标题、段落、代码块等）","支持列表操作（项目符号、有序、切换、缩进/取消缩进）","支持表格操作 via Tiptap 表格扩展","支持内容插入"],"ja":["高級 API でフォーマットコマンド（ボールド、イタリック、アンダーラインなど）をサポート","ブロックタイプの変更（見出し、段落、コードブロックなど）をサポート","リスト操作（ブルレット、オーダー、トグル、インデント/アウトデント）をサポート","Tiptap テーブル拡張によりテーブル操作をサポート","コンテンツ挿入をサポート"],"ko":["고급 API에서 형식 명령어（볼드、이탤릭、밑줄 등） 지원","블록 유형 변경（제목、段落、코드 블록 등） 지원","리스트 작업（블릿、순서、토글、인덴트/아웃덴트） 지원","Tiptap 표 확장 기능을 통해 표 작업 지원","컨텐츠 삽입 지원"],"es":["Formato de texto con comandos de negrita, cursiva y subrayado","Cambios de tipo de bloque para títulos, párrafos y bloques de código","Operaciones de lista con viñetas, numeradas y toggling","Operaciones de tabla con la extensión de tabla de Tiptap","Inserción de contenido con la API de Tiptap"],"fr":["Formatage de texte avec des commandes de gras, d''italique et de soulignement","Changements de type de bloc pour les titres, les paragraphes et les blocs de code","Opérations de liste avec des puces, des numéros et des toggling","Opérations de tableau avec l''extension de tableau de Tiptap","Insertion de contenu avec l''API de Tiptap"],"de":["Textformatierung mit Befehlen für fett, kursiv und unterstrichen","Blocktypänderungen für Überschriften, Absätze und Codeblöcke","Listenoperationen mit Aufzählungspunkten, nummerierten Listen und Umschalten","Tabellenoperationen mit der Tiptap-Tabellen-Erweiterung","Inhaltsinsertion mit der Tiptap-API"],"pt":["Formatar comandos de negrito, itálico e sublinhado","Alterar tipo de bloco, incluindo títulos e parágrafos","Operações de lista, incluindo marcas e numeração","Inserção de conteúdo via Tiptap API","Suporte a tabelas via extensão Tiptap Table"],"ru":["Форматирование команд жирного, курсивного и подчёркнутого текста","Изменение типа блока, включая заголовки и абзацы","Операции со списками, включая маркированные и нумерованные списки","Вставка контента через Tiptap API","Поддержка таблиц через расширение Tiptap Table"],"ar":["تنسيق أوامر النص المضغوط والمائل والتحت الخط","تغيير نوع الكتلة، بما في ذلك العناوين والفقرات","عمليات القائمة، بما في ذلك العلامات والترقيم","إدراج المحتوى عبر واجهة برمجة تطبيقات Tiptap","دعم الجداول عبر扩يع Tiptap Table"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use tiptap-editor","tiptap-editor alternative","tiptap-editor setup guide","what is tiptap-editor","tiptap-editor vs ProseMirror","tiptap-editor install","tiptap-editor API documentation","markdown editing with tiptap-editor","tiptap-editor for AI agents"],"zh":["Tiptap 编辑器","AI 编辑工具","Markdown 编辑器","高级 API","ProseMirror","格式命令","块类型更改","列表操作","表格操作"],"ja":["Tiptap エディター","AIエージェント","Markdown エディター","高級 API","ProseMirror","フォーマットコマンド","ブロックタイプの変更","リスト操作","テーブル操作"],"ko":["Tiptap 에디터","AI 에이전트","Markdown 편집기","고급 API","ProseMirror","형식 명령어","블록 유형 변경","리스트 작업","표 작업"],"es":["Tiptap Editor","editor de markdown","API de ProseMirror","formato de texto","cambios de tipo de bloque","operaciones de lista","operaciones de tabla","inserción de contenido","desarrollo de aplicaciones de markdown","herramientas de IA para desarrolladores"],"fr":["Tiptap Editor","éditeur de markdown","API ProseMirror","formatage de texte","changement de type de bloc","opérations de liste","opérations de tableau","insertion de contenu","développement d''applications de markdown","outils d''IA pour les développeurs"],"de":["Tiptap Editor","Markdown-Editor","ProseMirror-API","Textformatierung","Blocktypänderungen","Listenoperationen","Tabellenoperationen","Inhaltsinsertion","Entwicklung von Markdown-Anwendungen","KI-Tools für Entwickler"],"pt":["Tiptap Editor","editor de markdown","IA amigável","formatar comandos","operar blocos","desenvolver aplicativos de markdown","Tiptap API","ProseMirror"],"ru":["Tiptap Editor","редактор markdown","ИИ Агенты","форматирование команд","операции с блоками","разработка приложений с поддержкой ИИ","Tiptap API","ProseMirror"],"ar":["محرر Tiptap","محرر markdown","أدوات الاصطناعي","تنسيق الأوامر","عمليات الكتلة","تطوير تطبيقات دعم الاصطناعي","واجهة برمجة تطبيقات Tiptap","ProseMirror"]}},"owner":"xiaolai","repo":"vmark","repoPath":"xiaolai/vmark","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.347Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tiptap-editor","description":"Tiptap editor API patterns for vmark WYSIWYG development. Use when working with editor commands, node traversal, selection handling, or format operations.","bodyPreview":"# Tiptap Editor API Patterns\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill documents proper Tiptap API usage patterns for vmark development. It helps distinguish when to use Tiptap''s high-level API vs direct ProseMirror access.\n\n## When to Use Tiptap API\n\n**Always prefer Tiptap API for:**\n- Format commands (bold, italic, underline, etc.)\n- Block type changes (heading, paragraph, code block)\n- List operations (bullet, ordered, toggle, indent/outdent)\n- Table operations via Tiptap table extension\n- Content insertion a","body":"# Tiptap Editor API Patterns\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill documents proper Tiptap API usage patterns for vmark development. It helps distinguish when to use Tiptap''s high-level API vs direct ProseMirror access.\n\n## When to Use Tiptap API\n\n**Always prefer Tiptap API for:**\n- Format commands (bold, italic, underline, etc.)\n- Block type changes (heading, paragraph, code block)\n- List operations (bullet, ordered, toggle, indent/outdent)\n- Table operations via Tiptap table extension\n- Content insertion and replacement\n- Editor state queries (`isActive`, `getAttributes`)\n\n**Tiptap patterns to use:**\n```typescript\n// Direct commands\neditor.commands.toggleBold()\neditor.commands.setHeading({ level: 2 })\neditor.commands.setContent(doc, { emitUpdate: false })\n\n// Chained commands (for multiple operations)\neditor.chain().focus().setHeading({ level: 2 }).run()\neditor.chain().focus().toggleMark(\"underline\").run()\n\n// State queries\neditor.isActive(\"blockquote\")\neditor.isActive(\"heading\", { level: 2 })\neditor.getAttributes(\"link\")\n```\n\n## When Direct ProseMirror is Appropriate\n\n**Use ProseMirror directly for:**\n- Markdown conversion layer (`proseMirrorToMdast.ts`, `mdastToProseMirror.ts`)\n- Multi-cursor/selection subclassing (`MultiSelection.ts`)\n- Custom node views\n- Low-level transaction manipulation\n- Schema-level operations\n\n## Known Issues in vmark\n\n### 1. cursorHandlers.ts Block Boundary Issue\n`src/hooks/mcpBridge/cursorHandlers.ts` uses `doc.textContent` which flattens the document and loses block boundaries. The correct approach is to use `$pos` helpers:\n\n```typescript\n// WRONG - loses block structure\nconst text = doc.textContent;\n\n// RIGHT - respects block boundaries\nconst $pos = doc.resolve(from);\nconst currentNode = $pos.parent;\nconst blockStart = $pos.before($pos.depth);\nconst blockEnd = $pos.after($pos.depth);\n```\n\n### 2. Cursor Sync Drift After WYSIWYG Edits\n`sourceLine` attributes are only set on initial parse. After WYSIWYG edits that add/remove blocks, line numbers no longer match the source. This is a known limitation.\n\n### 3. HtmlNodeView.ts Store Issue\n`src/plugins/markdownArtifacts/HtmlNodeView.ts` writes cursor info to wrong store.\n\n## References\n\n- `references/patterns.md` - Detailed API patterns and $pos usage\n- `references/examples.md` - Real code examples from vmark codebase\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Identify operation type (format, block, selection, traversal)\n2. Check if Tiptap has a built-in command for it\n3. Use `editor.commands.xxx()` for single operations\n4. Use `editor.chain().focus().xxx().run()` when focus is needed or chaining\n5. For node traversal, use `doc.resolve(pos)` to get `$pos` helpers\n6. For state queries, use `editor.isActive()` or `editor.getAttributes()`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:03:39.108Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Cursor, Windsurf, and Claude Code requiring advanced markdown editing capabilities with Tiptap''s high-level API.","zh":"适用于像Cursor、Windsurf和Claude Code这样的AI代理，需要高级的markdown编辑功能，支持Tiptap的高级API。","ja":"Cursor、Windsurf、Claude CodeなどのAIエージェントに適しています。これらのエージェントは、Tiptapの高レベルAPIを使用した高度なマークダウン編集機能を必要とします。","ko":"Cursor, Windsurf 및 Claude Code와 같은 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다. 이러한 에이전트는 Tiptap의 고급 API를 사용하여 고급 마크다운 편집 기능을 필요로 합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf y Claude Code que requieren capacidades de edición de markdown avanzadas con la API de alto nivel de Tiptap.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA comme Cursor, Windsurf et Claude Code nécessitant des fonctionnalités de modification de markdown avancées avec l''API de haut niveau de Tiptap.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie Cursor, Windsurf und Claude Code, die erweiterte Markdown-Bearbeitungsfunktionen mit der High-Level-API von Tiptap erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf e Claude Code que exigem capacidades avançadas de edição de markdown com a API de alto nível do Tiptap.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Cursor, Windsurf и Claude Code, требующих продвинутых возможностей редактирования markdown с высокоуровневым API Tiptap.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Cursor و Windsurf و Claude Code الذين يتطلبون قدرات تحرير متقدمة لتنسيق markdown مع واجهة برمجة التطبيقات عالية المستوى Tiptap."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage Tiptap''s API for format commands, block type changes, list operations, and table operations via the Tiptap table extension, ensuring efficient and precise markdown editing with ProseMirror access.","zh":"赋予代理使用Tiptap的API进行格式命令、块类型更改、列表操作和表格操作，通过Tiptap表格扩展实现高效且精确的markdown编辑，并支持ProseMirror访问。","ja":"TiptapのAPIを使用して、フォーマットコマンド、ブロックタイプの変更、リスト操作、およびテーブル操作（Tiptapテーブル拡張を使用）を実行し、ProseMirrorへのアクセスを提供して、効率的で正確なマークダウン編集を可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 Tiptap의 API를 사용하여 형식 명령, 블록 유형 변경, 목록 작업 및 표 작업(Tiptap 표 확장 사용)을 수행하여 효율적이고 정확한 마크다운 편집을 가능하게 하고 ProseMirror 액세스를 제공합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes aprovechar la API de Tiptap para comandos de formato, cambios de tipo de bloque, operaciones de lista y operaciones de tabla a través de la extensión de tabla de Tiptap, asegurando una edición de markdown eficiente y precisa con acceso a ProseMirror.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''utiliser l''API de Tiptap pour les commandes de format, les modifications de type de bloc, les opérations de liste et les opérations de tableau via l''extension de tableau de Tiptap, assurant ainsi une modification de markdown efficace et précise avec un accès à ProseMirror.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, die API von Tiptap für Formatierungsanweisungen, Blocktypänderungen, Listenoperationen und Tabellenoperationen über die Tiptap-Tabellenerweiterung zu nutzen, um eine effiziente und präzise Markdown-Bearbeitung mit ProseMirror-Zugriff sicherzustellen.","pt":"Permite que os agentes aproveitem a API do Tiptap para comandos de formato, alterações de tipo de bloco, operações de lista e operações de tabela por meio da extensão de tabela do Tiptap, garantindo edição de markdown eficiente e precisa com acesso ao ProseMirror.","ru":"Позволяет агентам использовать API Tiptap для команд форматирования, изменений типа блока, операций со списками и операций с таблицами через расширение таблицы Tiptap, обеспечивая эффективное и точное редактирование markdown с доступом к ProseMirror.","ar":"تمكن العميل من استخدام واجهة برمجة التطبيقات Tiptap لاوامر التنسيق وتغيير نوع الكتلة وعمليات القائمة وعمليات الجدول من خلال توسيع جدول Tiptap، مما يضمن تحرير markdown فعال ودقيق مع وصول إلى ProseMirror."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating markdown formatting for documents","Generating tables with Tiptap''s table extension","Debugging ProseMirror integration issues"],"zh":["文档的自动markdown格式化","使用Tiptap的表格扩展生成表格","调试ProseMirror集成问题"],"ja":["文書の自動マークダウン整形","Tiptapのテーブル拡張を使用してテーブルを生成する","ProseMirrorの統合問題のデバッグ"],"ko":["문서의 자동 마크다운 형식화","Tiptap의 표 확장을 사용하여 표를 생성","ProseMirror 통합 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Automatizar el formato de markdown para documentos","Generar tablas con la extensión de tabla de Tiptap","Depurar problemas de integración de ProseMirror"],"fr":["Automatiser le formatage de markdown pour les documents","Générer des tableaux avec l''extension de tableau de Tiptap","Déboguer les problèmes d''intégration de ProseMirror"],"de":["Automatisieren des Markdown-Formats für Dokumente","Erstellen von Tabellen mit der Tiptap-Tabellenerweiterung","Beheben von ProseMirror-Integrationsproblemen"],"pt":["Automatizar formatação de markdown para documentos","Gerar tabelas com a extensão de tabela do Tiptap","Depurar problemas de integração do ProseMirror"],"ru":["Автоматизировать форматирование markdown для документов","Генерировать таблицы с помощью расширения таблицы Tiptap","Отладить проблемы интеграции ProseMirror"],"ar":["توفير تنسيق markdown آلي للوثائق","إنتاج جداول باستخدام امتداد جدول Tiptap","تصحيح مشاكل دمج ProseMirror"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Tiptap and ProseMirror integration","Limited to markdown editing use cases"],"zh":["需要Tiptap和ProseMirror集成","仅限于markdown编辑用例"],"ja":["TiptapとProseMirrorの統合が必要","マークダウン編集のユースケースに限定される"],"ko":["Tiptap 및 ProseMirror 통합 필요","마크다운 편집 유즈케이스에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere integración de Tiptap y ProseMirror","Limitado a casos de uso de edición de markdown"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration de Tiptap et ProseMirror","Limité aux cas d''utilisation de modification de markdown"],"de":["Erfordert die Integration von Tiptap und ProseMirror","Begrenzt auf Markdown-Bearbeitungsanwendungsfälle"],"pt":["Exige integração do Tiptap e do ProseMirror","Limitado a casos de uso de edição de markdown"],"ru":["Требует интеграции Tiptap и ProseMirror","Ограничен случаи использования редактирования markdown"],"ar":["يتطلب دمج Tiptap و ProseMirror","محدود لケースات استخدام تحرير markdown"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"4b9e90a774a5eebc21aa21d971dd7ea61dbcb0c11bd25f91b0817ee20e338aea","qualityScore":57}');
