es like ASCII art headers and diagram additions.","zh":"Grove Spec Writing 是一个用于创建和标准化技术规范的 AI 工具","ja":"Grove Spec Writing は、テクニカルスペックの作成と標準化を支援する AI エージェントです","ko":"Grove Spec Writing은 기술 사양을 생성하고 표준화하기 위한 AI 도구입니다","es":"Grove Spec Writing es una herramienta de escritura de especificaciones técnicas para el ecosistema de Grove.","fr":"Grove Spec Writing est un outil d''écriture de spécifications techniques pour l''écosystème Grove.","de":"Grove Spec Writing ist ein Werkzeug für das Schreiben technischer Spezifikationen im Grove-Ökosystem.","pt":"O que é Grove Spec Writing? É uma ferramenta de AI para criar e validar especificações técnicas em plataformas de blog multi-tenant","ru":"Что такое Grove Spec Writing? Это инструмент ИИ для создания и проверки технических спецификаций на платформах блогов с несколькими арендаторами","ar":"ما هو Grove Spec Writing؟ هو أداة ذكاء اصطناعي لإنشاء وتحقق من المواصفات الفنية على منصات المدونات المتعددة"},"features":{"en":["Creates new specs with storybook-like entries","Validates and standardizes existing specs for completeness","Adds ASCII art headers to specs missing them","Supports adding diagrams, mockups, or visual elements to text-heavy specs","Standardizes frontmatter across spec files","Validates specs to ensure consistency"],"zh":["创建新技术规范","验证和标准化现有的规范","添加 ASCII 艺术标题","添加图表和视觉元素","标准化 frontmatter"],"ja":["新しいテクニカルスペックの作成","既存のスペックの検証と標準化","ASCII アートヘッダーの追加","図や視覚要素の追加","フロントマターの標準化"],"ko":["새로운 기술 사양 생성","기존 사양의 검증 및 표준화","ASCII 아트 제목 추가","다이어그램 및 시각적 요소 추가","프론트매터의 표준화"],"es":["Creación de nuevos specs con en-têtes ASCII art","Validación y estandarización de specs existentes","Incorporación de diagramas y elementos visuales a specs de texto","Estandarización de frontmatter en archivos de specs","Mejora de la calidad de los specs con elementos visuales"],"fr":["Création de nouveaux specs avec des en-têtes ASCII art","Validation et standardisation de specs existants","Intégration de diagrammes et d''éléments visuels à des specs de texte","Standardisation de frontmatter dans les fichiers de specs","Amélioration de la qualité des specs avec des éléments visuels"],"de":["Erstellung neuer Specs mit ASCII-Kunst-Headern","Validierung und Standardisierung bestehender Specs","Einbindung von Diagrammen und visuellen Elementen in Text-Specs","Standardisierung von Frontmatter in Spezifikationsdateien","Verbesserung der Qualität von Specs mit visuellen Elementen"],"pt":["Criação de especificações técnicas como entradas de storybook","Validação e standardização de especificações existentes","Adição de cabeçalhos em ASCII art","Adição de diagramas, mockups e elementos visuais","Standardização de frontmatter em arquivos de especificações"],"ru":["Создание технических спецификаций как записей storybook","Проверка и стандартизация существующих спецификаций","Добавление заголовков в формате ASCII art","Добавление диаграмм, макетов и визуальных элементов","Стандартизация frontmatter в файлах спецификаций"],"ar":["إنشاء مواصفات فنية مثل مدخلات storybook","التحقق والتوحيد للمواصفات الحالية","إضافة عناوين ASCII art","إضافة مخططات وتصاميم واضافات بصرية","توحيد frontmatter في ملفات المواصفات"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use grove-spec-writing","grove-spec-writing setup guide","grove-spec-writing alternative","grove-spec-writing vs storybook","what is grove-spec-writing","grove-spec-writing install","technical specification writing tools","grove ecosystem specs","spec writing best practices"],"zh":["Grove Spec Writing","技术规范编写","AI 工具","ASCII 艺术标题","图表和视觉元素","标准化 frontmatter"],"ja":["Grove Spec Writing","テクニカルスペックの作成","AI エージェント","ASCII アートヘッダー","図と視覚要素","フロントマターの標準化"],"ko":["Grove Spec Writing","기술 사양 작성","AI 도구","ASCII 아트 제목","다이어그램 및 시각적 요소","프론트매터의 표준화"],"es":["herramientas de AI para desarrolladores","escritura de especificaciones técnicas","Grove Spec Writing","creación de specs","validación de specs","estandarización de specs","ASCII art en specs","diagramas en specs"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour développeurs","écriture de spécifications techniques","Grove Spec Writing","création de specs","validation de specs","standardisation de specs","ASCII art dans les specs","diagrammes dans les specs"],"de":["AI-Tools für Entwickler","Schreiben technischer Spezifikationen","Grove Spec Writing","Erstellung von Specs","Validierung von Specs","Standardisierung von Specs","ASCII-Kunst in Specs","Diagramme in Specs"],"pt":["Grove Spec Writing","Multi-tenant blog platform","Especificação técnica","AI para desenvolvedores","Ferramenta de AI para blog","Criar especificações técnicas","Validar especificações","Standardizar frontmatter"],"ru":["Grove Spec Writing","Платформа блогов с несколькими арендаторами","Техническая спецификация","ИИ для разработчиков","Инструмент ИИ для блогов","Создание технических спецификаций","Проверка спецификаций","Стандартизация frontmatter"],"ar":["Grove Spec Writing","منصات المدونات المتعددة","المواصفات الفنية","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي للمدونات","إنشاء المواصفات الفنية","التحقق من المواصفات","توحيد frontmatter"]}},"owner":"AutumnsGrove","repo":"GroveEngine","repoPath":"AutumnsGrove/GroveEngine","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.349Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"grove-spec-writing","description":"Write and validate Grove technical specifications with consistent formatting, ASCII art headers, diagrams, and the Grove voice. Use when creating new specs, reviewing existing specs for completeness, or standardizing spec formatting.","bodyPreview":"# Grove Spec Writing\n\nA comprehensive guide for writing technical specifications in the Grove ecosystem. Use this skill to create new specs that feel like storybook entries, or to validate and standardize existing specs.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- Creating a new technical specification\n- Reviewing an existing spec for completeness\n- Adding ASCII art headers to specs missing them\n- Adding diagrams, mockups, or visual elements to text-heavy specs\n- Standardizing frontmatter across spec files\n- Valida","body":"# Grove Spec Writing\n\nA comprehensive guide for writing technical specifications in the Grove ecosystem. Use this skill to create new specs that feel like storybook entries, or to validate and standardize existing specs.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- Creating a new technical specification\n- Reviewing an existing spec for completeness\n- Adding ASCII art headers to specs missing them\n- Adding diagrams, mockups, or visual elements to text-heavy specs\n- Standardizing frontmatter across spec files\n- Validating a spec against Grove standards before finalizing\n\n---\n\n## The Spec as Storybook Entry\n\nGrove specs aren''t just technical documents. They''re **storybook entries** in a larger narrative. Each spec should feel like opening a page in a beautifully illustrated field guide to the forest.\n\n**The formula:**\n1. **Cover page** (frontmatter + ASCII art + tagline)\n2. **Introduction** (what is this, in nature and in Grove)\n3. **The journey** (architecture, flows, implementation)\n4. **The details** (API, schema, security)\n5. **The path forward** (implementation checklist)\n\n---\n\n## Required Structure\n\n### 1. Frontmatter (REQUIRED)\n\nEvery spec MUST have this exact frontmatter format:\n\n```yaml\n---\naliases: []\ndate created: [Day], [Month] [Ordinal] [Year]\ndate modified: [Day], [Month] [Ordinal] [Year]\ntags:\n  - primary-domain\n  - tech-stack\n  - category\ntype: tech-spec\n---\n```\n\n**Date format examples:**\n- `Monday, December 29th 2025`\n- `Saturday, January 4th 2026`\n\n**Type options:**\n- `tech-spec` — Technical specification (most common)\n- `implementation-plan` — Step-by-step implementation guide\n- `index` — Index/navigation document\n\n### 2. ASCII Art Header (REQUIRED)\n\nImmediately after frontmatter, include a code block with ASCII art that visually represents the concept:\n\n```\n# [Name] — [Short Description]\n\n```\n         ASCII ART HERE\n         representing the concept\n         in a visual way\n```\n\n> *Poetic tagline in italics*\n```\n\n**Good ASCII art:**\n- Relates to the nature metaphor (forest, garden, etc.)\n- Represents the concept visually (layers for backup, rings for analytics)\n- Uses box-drawing characters: `─│┌┐└┘├┤┬┴┼╭╮╰╯`\n- Uses nature emoji sparingly: `🌲🌿🍂✨🌸`\n- Includes a poetic tagline or motto\n\n**Examples from excellent specs:**\n\n**Wisp (will-o''-the-wisp light):**\n```\n         🌲  🌲  🌲\n          \\   |   /\n           \\  |  /\n             ✨\n            ╱ ╲\n           ╱   ╲\n          ╱  ·  ╲\n         ╱   ·   ╲\n        ╱    ·    ╲\n       ·     ·     ·\n         gentle\n         guiding\n          light\n```\n\n**Patina (layered backups):**\n```\n                     ╭───────────────────╮\n                    ╭┤  ┌─────────────┐  ├╮\n                   ╭┤│  │  2026-01-05 │  │├╮\n                   │││  │  ▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓ │  │││\n                   │││  │  ▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒ │  │││\n                   │││  │  ░░░░░░░░░░ │  │││\n                   │││  │  ·········· │  │││\n                   ╰┴┴──└─────────────┘──┴┴╯\n                  ╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╱\n               ──────────────────────────────\n              ~~~~~~~~ oxidation layer ~~~~~~~~\n              Age as armor. Time as protection.\n```\n\n**Heartwood (tree rings):**\n```\n                      ╭──────────╮\n                   ╭──│ ╭──────╮ │──╮\n                 ╭─│  │ │ ╭──╮ │ │  │─╮\n                │  │  │ │ │♥ │ │ │  │  │\n                 ╰─│  │ │ ╰──╯ │ │  │─╯\n                   ╰──│ ╰──────╯ │──╯\n                      ╰──────────╯\n\n       every ring: a year, a story, a layer of growth\n\n               The center that holds it all.\n```\n\n### 3. Introduction Section\n\nAfter the ASCII art header:\n\n```markdown\n> *Poetic tagline repeated*\n\n[2-3 sentence description of what this is in the Grove ecosystem]\n\n**Public Name:** [Name]\n**Internal Name:** Grove[Name]\n**Domain:** `name.grove.place`\n**Repository:** [Link if applicable]\n**Last Updated:** [Month Year]\n\n[1-2 paragraphs explaining the nature metaphor and how it applies]\n\n---\n```\n\n### 4. Body Sections\n\nOrganize content with clear headers. Include:\n\n- **Overview/Goals** — What this system does\n- **Architecture** — How it''s built (with diagrams!)\n- **Tech Stack** — Dependencies, frameworks\n- **API/Schema** — Technical details\n- **Security** — Important considerations\n- **Implementation Checklist** — Clear action items\n\n---\n\n## Required Visual Elements\n\n### Flow Diagrams\n\nEvery spec describing a process MUST include at least one ASCII flow diagram:\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                         Client Sites                                │\n│  ┌──────────────┐  ┌──────────────┐  ┌──────────────┐               │\n│  │   Site A     │  │   Site B     │  │   Site C     │               │\n│  └──────┬───────┘  └──────┬───────┘  └──────┬───────┘               │\n└─────────┼─────────────────┼─────────────────┼───────────────────────┘\n          │                 │                 │\n          │    1. Request   │                 │\n          ▼                 ▼                 ▼\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                        Central Service                              │\n│                                                                     │\n│  ┌─────────────────────────┐  ┌─────────────────────────┐           │\n│  │      Handler A          │  │      Handler B          │           │\n│  └─────────────────────────┘  └─────────────────────────┘           │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n**Box drawing reference:**\n- Corners: `┌ ┐ └ ┘` (square) or `╭ ╮ ╰ ╯` (rounded)\n- Lines: `─ │ ═ ║`\n- Joins: `├ ┤ ┬ ┴ ┼`\n- Arrows: `→ ← ↑ ↓ ▶ ◀ ▲ ▼`\n\n### UI Mockups\n\nSpecs describing user interfaces MUST include ASCII mockups:\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  ✧ Panel Title                                          [×]      │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│                                                                 │\n│  ┌─ Label ────────────────────────────────────────────────┐     │\n│  │ Content here with proper spacing                       │     │\n│  └────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘     │\n│                                                                 │\n│  ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐    │\n│  │ Input field...                                     [↵]  │    │\n│  └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘    │\n│                                                                 │\n│  ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────    │\n│  [ Action A ]                              [ Action B ✦ ]       │\n│                                                                 │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n### State Diagrams\n\nFor features with multiple states:\n\n```\n   Idle:                    Analyzing:               Success:\n   .  *  .    .  *         . * . analyzing . *           *\n  .    _    .      .         \\  |  /             .    *  /|\\   .\n     /   \\    *  .         -- (o.o) --  thinking    *   / | \\    *\n    / ~ ~ \\  .    .          /  |  \\                   /__|__\\\n   /       \\______        ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~       ~~~~/       \\~~~~\n  ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~       words flowing...        all clear\n```\n\n### Comparison Tables\n\nUse tables to compare options, states, or configurations:\n\n```markdown\n| Feature | Seedling | Sapling | Oak | Evergreen |\n|---------|----------|---------|-----|-----------|\n| Posts   | 50       | 250     | ∞   | ∞         |\n| Storage | 1 GB     | 5 GB    | 20 GB | 100 GB  |\n| Themes  | 3        | 10      | All | All + custom |\n```\n\n### Timeline/Retention Diagrams\n\nFor anything involving time:\n\n```\n  TODAY                                              12 WEEKS AGO\n    │                                                      │\n    ▼                                                      ▼\n   ┌─┬─┬─┬─┬─┬─┬─┐                                        ┌─┐\n   │█│█│█│█│█│█│█│ ◀── Daily backups (7 days)             │░│\n   └─┴─┴─┴─┴─┴─┴─┘                                        └─┘\n   S M T W T F S\n```\n\n---\n\n## Validation Checklist\n\nBefore finalizing any spec, verify:\n\n### Structure\n- [ ] Frontmatter present with all required fields\n- [ ] `aliases: []` included (even if empty)\n- [ ] Date format correct (Day, Month Ordinal Year)\n- [ ] `type: tech-spec` or appropriate type\n- [ ] ASCII art header present after frontmatter\n- [ ] Poetic tagline in italics\n- [ ] Public/Internal names listed\n- [ ] Domain specified (if applicable)\n\n### Visual Content\n- [ ] At least one ASCII flow diagram (if process-based)\n- [ ] UI mockups included (if describing interface)\n- [ ] Tables for comparisons where appropriate\n- [ ] Code blocks for technical details\n- [ ] No walls of text without visual breaks\n\n### Voice (refer to grove-documentation skill)\n- [ ] No em-dashes (use periods or commas)\n- [ ] No \"not X, but Y\" patterns\n- [ ] No AI-coded words (robust, seamless, leverage, etc.)\n- [ ] Short paragraphs\n- [ ] Poetic closers earned, not forced\n\n### Completeness\n- [ ] Overview/Goals section\n- [ ] Architecture diagram\n- [ ] Technical details (API, schema)\n- [ ] Security considerations\n- [ ] Implementation checklist\n\n---\n\n## Creating ASCII Art\n\n### The Process\n\n1. **Identify the core metaphor** — What natural thing does this represent?\n2. **Sketch the concept** — What visual would convey this at a glance?\n3. **Choose your characters** — Box drawing, emoji, or creative ASCII\n4. **Build in layers** — Start with outline, add detail, add flourishes\n5. **Add the tagline** — Poetic one-liner that captures the essence\n\n### Character Palette\n\n**Box Drawing (safe, consistent):**\n```\n┌─────┬─────┐    ╭─────╮\n│     │     │    │     │\n├─────┼─────┤    ╰─────╯\n│     │     │\n└─────┴─────┘\n```\n\n**Lines and Arrows:**\n```\n→ ← ↑ ↓ ↔ ↕\n▶ ◀ ▲ ▼\n⟿ ⟸ ⟹\n```\n\n**Nature Emoji (use sparingly):**\n```\n🌲 🌳 🌿 🍂 🍃 🌸 🌺 🌻 🌷 🌱 🍄\n☀️ 🌤️ ⭐ ✨ 💧 🔥\n🦋 🐛 🐌\n```\n\n**Decorative:**\n```\n· ∙ • ° ˚ ∘\n~ ≈ ∿\n═ ║ ╔ ╗ ╚ ╝\n░ ▒ ▓ █\n```\n\n### Tips\n\n- Keep ASCII art under 20 lines tall\n- Center the art within its code block\n- Include breathing room (empty lines above/below)\n- Test in a monospace font\n- Consider mobile rendering (simpler is better)\n\n---\n\n## Example: Complete Spec Header\n\n```markdown\n---\naliases: []\ndate created: Monday, January 6th 2026\ndate modified: Monday, January 13th 2026\ntags:\n  - support\n  - user-communication\n  - cloudflare-workers\ntype: tech-spec\n---\n\n# Porch — Support System\n\n```\n                              🏠\n                           ___│___\n                          │       │\n                    ~~~~~~│ PORCH │~~~~~~\n                         ╱│_______│╲\n                        ╱           ╲\n                       ╱  ┌───┐      ╲\n                      ╱   │ ☕ │       ╲\n                     ╱    └───┘ 👤     ╲\n                    ════════════════════════\n                           steps\n\n              Have a seat. We''ll figure it out.\n```\n\n> *Have a seat on the porch. We''ll figure it out together.*\n\nGrove''s front porch: a warm, accessible space where users sit down and have a conversation. Not a corporate help desk with ticket numbers. A porch where you chat with the grove keeper about what''s going on.\n\n**Public Name:** Porch\n**Internal Name:** GrovePorch\n**Domain:** `porch.grove.place`\n**Status:** Planned (Launch Priority)\n\nA porch is where you sit and talk. You come up the steps, have a seat, and the grove keeper comes out to chat. It''s not a ticket counter. It''s two people on a porch, figuring things out together.\n\n---\n```\n\n---\n\n## Integration with Other Skills\n\n### Before Writing a Spec\n\n1. **walking-through-the-grove** — If naming a new feature, complete the naming journey first\n2. **grove-ui-design** — If the spec involves UI, understand design patterns\n\n### While Writing\n\n3. **grove-documentation** — Apply Grove voice throughout, avoid AI patterns\n\n### After Writing\n\n4. **grove-spec-writing** (this skill) — Run validation checklist\n5. Review with fresh eyes: Does it feel like a storybook entry?\n\n### When to Use museum-documentation Instead\n\nThis skill (grove-spec-writing) is for **internal technical specifications**: architecture decisions, system design, implementation plans. Documentation for developers.\n\nUse **museum-documentation** when writing for **Wanderers who want to understand**:\n\n| Use grove-spec-writing | Use museum-documentation |\n|-----------------------|-------------------------|\n| Technical specifications | \"How it works\" for curious visitors |\n| Architecture decisions | Codebase guided tours |\n| Implementation plans | Knowledge base exhibits |\n| Internal system docs | Narrative technical explanations |\n\nIf the reader is a **developer implementing something**, use this skill.\nIf the reader is a **Wanderer exploring the forest**, use museum-documentation.\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Element | Required | Location |\n|---------|----------|----------|\n| Frontmatter | Yes | Top of file |\n| ASCII art header | Yes | After frontmatter |\n| Poetic tagline | Yes | After ASCII art |\n| Public/Internal names | Yes | Introduction |\n| Architecture diagram | If applicable | Body |\n| UI mockups | If has UI | Body |\n| Implementation checklist | Yes | End of spec |\n\n---\n\n*A good spec is one you''d want to read at 2 AM. Make it beautiful.*\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:03:44.439Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Technical Writing Agents needing standardized specification creation in the Grove ecosystem.","zh":"非常适合需要在 Grove 生态系统中创建标准化规范的技术写作代理。","ja":"Grove エコシステムで標準化された仕様の作成が必要なテクニカルライティングエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Grove 생태계에서 표준화된 사양을 생성해야 하는 기술 작성 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Escritura Técnica que necesitan creación de especificaciones estandarizadas en el ecosistema Grove.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de rédaction technique ayant besoin de création de spécifications standardisées dans l''écosystème Grove.","de":"Perfekt für technische Schreibagenten, die standardisierte Spezifikationserstellung im Grove-Ökosystem benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Escrita Técnica que precisam de criação de especificações padronizadas no ecossistema Grove.","ru":"Идеально для агентов технического письма, которым необходима стандартизированная создание спецификаций в экосистеме Grove.","ar":"مثالي لوسائل كتابة تقنية تحتاج إلى إنشاء مواصفات معيارية في نظام Grove."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate and standardize technical specifications with ASCII art headers, diagrams, and frontmatter validation, utilizing specs in a standardized format for seamless integration.","zh":"使代理能够生成和标准化技术规范，使用 ASCII 艺术标题、图表和前置内容验证，利用标准化格式的规范实现无缝集成。","ja":"エージェントがASCIIアートヘッダー、図、フロントマターの検証を使用して技術仕様を生成、標準化できるようにし、標準化された形式の仕様を使用して無縫に統合できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 ASCII 아트 헤더, 다이어그램 및 프론트매터 유효성을 사용하여 기술 사양을 생성하고 표준화할 수 있도록 하며, 표준화된 형식의 사양을 사용하여 무결점 통합을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes generar y estandarizar especificaciones técnicas con encabezados de arte ASCII, diagramas y validación de frontmatter, utilizando especificaciones en un formato estandarizado para una integración sin problemas, utilizando React, Python, CLI, API y otros frameworks.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer et de standardiser les spécifications techniques avec des en-têtes d''art ASCII, des diagrams et une validation de frontmatter, en utilisant des spécifications dans un format standardisé pour une intégration sans problème, en utilisant React, Python, CLI, API et d''autres frameworks.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, technische Spezifikationen mit ASCII-Kunst-Headern, Diagrammen und Frontmatter-Validierung zu generieren und zu standardisieren, indem Spezifikationen in einem standardisierten Format für eine nahtlose Integration verwendet werden, unter Verwendung von React, Python, CLI, API und anderen Frameworks.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar e padronizar especificações técnicas com cabeçalhos de arte ASCII, diagramas e validação de frontmatter, utilizando especificações em um formato padronizado para integração sem problemas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать и стандартизировать технические спецификации с заголовками ASCII-искусства, диаграммами и проверкой frontmatter, используя спецификации в стандартизированном формате для бесперебойной интеграции.","ar":"تمكّن العوامل من إنشاء مواصفات تقنية معيارية مع عناوين فنية ASCII ورسومات وتحقق من البطاقات الأمامية، باستخدام المواصفات في تنسيق معياري من أجل التكامل السلس."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating new technical specifications with storybook-style entries","Reviewing existing specs for completeness and standardization","Adding visual elements like diagrams and mockups to text-heavy specs"],"zh":["使用故事书风格的条目创建新的技术规范","检查现有的规范以确保完整性和标准化","向文本密集的规范添加可视化元素，如图表和模拟图"],"ja":["ストーリーブックスタイルのエントリを使用して新しいテクニカル仕様を生成する","既存の仕様を確認して完全性と標準化を確認する","テキスト密度の高い仕様に図やモックアップなどの視覚要素を追加する"],"ko":["스토리북 스타일의 항목을 사용하여 새로운 기술 사양을 생성하는 것","기존 사양의 완전성 및 표준화를 확인하는 것","텍스트가 많은 사양에 다이어그램 및 모의 업などの 시각적 요소를 추가하는 것"],"es":["Crear nuevas especificaciones técnicas con entradas de estilo storybook","Revisar especificaciones existentes para comprobar su completitud y estandarización","Agregar elementos visuales como diagramas y prototipos a especificaciones densas de texto"],"fr":["Créer de nouvelles spécifications techniques avec des entrées de style storybook","Réviser les spécifications existantes pour vérifier leur complétude et standardisation","Ajouter des éléments visuels tels que des diagrammes et des prototypes à des spécifications chargées de texte"],"de":["Erstellen neuer technischer Spezifikationen mit storybook-Style-Einträgen","Überprüfen bestehender Spezifikationen auf Vollständigkeit und Standardisierung","Hinzufügen visueller Elemente wie Diagramme und Mockups zu textlastigen Spezifikationen"],"pt":["Criar novas especificações técnicas com entradas no estilo storybook","Revisar especificações existentes para completude e padronização","Adicionar elementos visuais como diagramas e protótipos a especificações textuais"],"ru":["Создание новых технических спецификаций с записями в стиле storybook","Проверка существующих спецификаций на полноту и стандартизацию","Добавление визуальных элементов, таких как диаграммы и макеты, к текстовым спецификациям"],"ar":["إنشاء مواصفات تقنية جديدة بالمدخلات على نمط storybook","مراجعة المواصفات الحالية للكامل والتوحيد","إضافة عناصر بصرية مثل الرسومات والنماذج الأولية إلى مواصفات نصية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of the Grove ecosystem","Limited to technical specification writing and review"],"zh":["需要了解 Grove 生态系统","仅限于技术规范的编写和审查"],"ja":["Grove エコシステムの知識が必要","テクニカル仕様の作成、レビューのみに限定される"],"ko":["Grove 생태계에 대한 지식이 필요","기술 사양 작성 및 검토에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento del ecosistema Grove","Limitado a la escritura y revisión de especificaciones técnicas"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance de l''écosystème Grove","Limité à la rédaction et à la révision de spécifications techniques"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse des Grove-Ökosystems","Begrenzt auf Erstellung und Überprüfung technischer Spezifikationen"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento do ecossistema Grove","Limitado à escrita e revisão de especificações técnicas"],"ru":["Требует знания экосистемы Grove","Ограничен написанием и проверкой технических спецификаций"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بنية Grove","محدود بالكتابة والمراجعة للمواصفات التقنية"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"5bbb13eb32ebf94593fce9ee588edb50e66ba39347041a7a06947e3d94d48ad4","qualityScore":57}');
