rdizes asset management by determining output paths and naming conventions for various asset types, including articles, images, and videos.","zh":"AI资产组织工具是一种标准化资产输出的路径、命名约定和目录结构的技术","ja":"AIエージェントによるアセット整理とは、アセットの出力パス、命名規則、ディレクトリ構造を標準化する技術です","ko":"AI 에이전트를 활용한 자산 구성이란 자산의 출력 경로, 이름 지정 규칙 및 디렉토리 구조를 표준화하는 기술입니다","es":"La organización de activos es el proceso de standardizar la salida de activos de marketing, incluyendo rutas de salida, convenciones de nomenclatura y estructuras de directorios.","fr":"L''organisation d''actifs est le processus de standardisation de la sortie d''actifs de marketing, y compris les chemins de sortie, les conventions de nommage et les structures de répertoires.","de":"Die Organisation von Assets ist der Prozess der Standardisierung der Ausgabe von Marketing-Assets, einschließlich Ausgabepfaden, Namenskonventionen und Verzeichnisstrukturen.","pt":"Organização de ativos é a padronização de saída, nomeação e estrutura de diretório para ativos de marketing","ru":"Организация активов - это стандартизация вывода, именования и структуры директорий для маркетинговых активов","ar":"تنظيم الأصول هو تحديد معايير الإخراج والتسمية وهيكل الدلائل للأصول التسويقية"},"features":{"en":["Standardizes asset output locations using directory structures like `assets/articles/`","Determines output paths for new content types, such as videos and designs","Generates consistent naming conventions for assets, including articles and images","Organizes existing assets using standardized directory structures","Supports AI asset generation, including images, storyboards, and scripts"],"zh":["标准化输出路径","命名约定管理","目录结构组织","支持多种资产类型（文章、视频、设计）","适用于创建内容、生成AI资产和组织现有资产"],"ja":["出力パスの標準化","命名規則の管理","ディレクトリ構造の組織化","多種多様なアセットタイプ（記事、ビデオ、デザイン）をサポート","コンテンツの作成、AIアセットの生成、既存アセットの整理に適しています"],"ko":["출력 경로 표준화","이름 지정 규칙 관리","디렉토리 구조 구성","다양한 자산 유형（기사, 비디오, 디자인）을 지원","콘텐츠 생성, AI 자산 생성 및 기존 자산 구성에 적합합니다"],"es":["Establece rutas de salida personalizadas para activos de marketing","Standardiza convenciones de nomenclatura para activos","Crea estructuras de directorios organizadas para activos","Soporta la generación de activos de IA, como imágenes y storyboards","Permite la determinación de rutas de salida para nuevos tipos de contenido"],"fr":["Établit des chemins de sortie personnalisés pour les actifs de marketing","Standardise les conventions de nommage pour les actifs","Crée des structures de répertoires organisées pour les actifs","Prend en charge la génération d''actifs d''IA, tels que des images et des storyboards","Permet la détermination des chemins de sortie pour les nouveaux types de contenu"],"de":["Legt benutzerdefinierte Ausgabepfade für Marketing-Assets fest","Standardisiert Namenskonventionen für Assets","Erstellt organisierte Verzeichnisstrukturen für Assets","Unterstützt die Generierung von KI-Assets, wie Bildern und Storyboards","Ermöglicht die Festlegung von Ausgabepfaden für neue Inhaltsarten"],"pt":["Padronização de saída de ativos","Nomeação de ativos com convenções claras","Estrutura de diretório para conteúdo de marketing","Suporte a múltiplos tipos de ativos","Integração com Ferramentas de IA para automação"],"ru":["Стандартизация вывода активов","Именование активов с ясными конвенциями","Структура директорий для маркетингового контента","Поддержка нескольких типов активов","Интеграция с ИИ Агентами для автоматизации"],"ar":["تحديد معايير الإخراج للأصول","تسمية الأصول باتباع اتفاقيات واضحة","هيكل الدلائل للمحتوى التسويقي","دعم أنواع متعددة من الأصول","التكامل مع آلات التعلم الإصطناعي للتحكم الآلي"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use assets-organizing","what is assets-organizing","assets-organizing setup guide","assets-organizing alternative","assets-organizing vs manual organization","standardized asset management","asset naming conventions","directory structure best practices"],"zh":["AI资产组织工具","资产输出路径标准化","命名约定管理","目录结构组织","创建内容","生成AI资产","组织现有资产","标准化输出路径"],"ja":["AIエージェントによるアセット整理","アセットの出力パス標準化","命名規則の管理","ディレクトリ構造の組織化","コンテンツの作成","AIアセットの生成","既存アセットの整理","出力パスの標準化"],"ko":["AI 에이전트를 활용한 자산 구성","자산의 출력 경로 표준화","이름 지정 규칙 관리","디렉토리 구조 구성","콘텐츠 생성","AI 자산 생성","기존 자산 구성","출력 경로 표준화"],"es":["organización de activos","Agentes de IA para marketing","standardización de activos","rutas de salida personalizadas","convenciones de nomenclatura","estructuras de directorios","generación de activos de IA","determinación de rutas de salida"],"fr":["organisation d''actifs","outils d''IA pour le marketing","standardisation d''actifs","chemins de sortie personnalisés","conventions de nommage","structures de répertoires","génération d''actifs d''IA","détermination des chemins de sortie"],"de":["Organisation von Assets","KI-Tools für Marketing","Standardisierung von Assets","benutzerdefinierte Ausgabepfade","Namenskonventionen","Verzeichnisstrukturen","Generierung von KI-Assets","Festlegung von Ausgabepfaden"],"pt":["organização de ativos","Ferramentas de IA","marketing de conteúdo","padronização de saída","nomeação de ativos","estrutura de diretório","automação de marketing","otimização de ativos"],"ru":["организация активов","ИИ Агенты","маркетинг контента","стандартизация вывода","именование активов","структура директорий","автоматизация маркетинга","оптимизация активов"],"ar":["تنظيم الأصول","آلات التعلم الإصطناعي","تسويق المحتوى","تحديد معايير الإخراج","تسمية الأصول","هيكل الدلائل","التحكم الآلي للتسويق","تحسين الأصول"]}},"owner":"NammDev","repo":"Goads-Krea","repoPath":"NammDev/Goads-Krea","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.350Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"assets-organizing","description":"Organize all outputs from slash commands and subagents in assets/ directory by topics, date format, and slugs.","bodyPreview":"# Assets Organizing\n\nStandardize asset output locations, naming conventions, and directory structures for all marketing outputs.\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Creating content that needs file output (articles, videos, designs)\n- Generating AI assets (images, storyboards, scripts)\n- Organizing existing assets\n- Determining output paths for new content types\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Output Paths\n\n| Asset Type | Path | Naming |\n|------------|------|--------|\n| Articles | `assets/articles/","body":"# Assets Organizing\n\nStandardize asset output locations, naming conventions, and directory structures for all marketing outputs.\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Creating content that needs file output (articles, videos, designs)\n- Generating AI assets (images, storyboards, scripts)\n- Organizing existing assets\n- Determining output paths for new content types\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Output Paths\n\n| Asset Type | Path | Naming |\n|------------|------|--------|\n| Articles | `assets/articles/{date}-{slug}/` | `{slug}.md` + `images/{date}-{slug}/` |\n| Storyboards | `assets/storyboards/{date}-{slug}/` | `storyboard.md` + `scene-{N}-*.png` |\n| Videos | `assets/videos/{date}-{slug}/` | `master.mp4` + `scene-{N}.mp4` |\n| Transcripts | `assets/transcripts/` | `{slug}.md` |\n| Writing Styles | `assets/writing-styles/` | `{slug}.md` |\n| Banners | `assets/banners/{campaign}/` | `{variant}-{size}.{ext}` |\n| Designs | `assets/designs/{project}/` | `{type}-{variant}.{ext}` |\n| Infographics | `assets/infographics/` | `{date}-{slug}.{ext}` |\n| Logos | `assets/logos/` | `{name}-{variant}.{ext}` |\n| Social Posts | `assets/posts/{platform}/` | `{date}-{slug}.{ext}` |\n| Generated | `assets/generated/{type}/` | `{date}-{slug}.{ext}` |\n| **Reports** | | |\n| Analytics | `assets/reports/analytics/` | `{date}-{report-type}.md` |\n| SEO | `assets/reports/seo/` | `{date}-{audit-type}.md` |\n| Social | `assets/reports/social/` | `{date}-{platform}-{report-type}.md` |\n| Campaign | `assets/reports/campaigns/` | `{date}-{campaign}-{report-type}.md` |\n| Performance | `assets/reports/performance/` | `{date}-{channel}-report.md` |\n| Ads | `assets/reports/ads/` | `{date}-{platform}-report.md` |\n| Email | `assets/reports/email/` | `{date}-{campaign}-report.md` |\n| Funnel | `assets/reports/funnels/` | `{date}-{funnel}-analysis.md` |\n| Content | `assets/reports/content/` | `{date}-{content-type}-audit.md` |\n| **Text Content** | | |\n| Copy | `assets/copy/{type}/` | `{date}-{slug}.md` |\n| Ad Copy | `assets/copy/ads/` | `{date}-{campaign}-{variant}.md` |\n| Email Copy | `assets/copy/emails/` | `{date}-{sequence}-{slug}.md` |\n| Landing Pages | `assets/copy/landing-pages/` | `{slug}.md` |\n| Headlines | `assets/copy/headlines/` | `{date}-{topic}.md` |\n| Scripts | `assets/scripts/{type}/` | `{slug}.md` |\n| **Campaigns** | | |\n| Campaign Briefs | `assets/campaigns/{date}-{slug}/briefs/` | `{type}-brief.md` |\n| Campaign Creatives | `assets/campaigns/{date}-{slug}/creatives/` | `{channel}-{variant}.{ext}` |\n| Campaign Reports | `assets/campaigns/{date}-{slug}/reports/` | `{date}-{report-type}.md` |\n| Campaign Assets | `assets/campaigns/{date}-{slug}/assets/` | `{type}-{name}.{ext}` |\n| **Sales** | | |\n| Pitches | `assets/sales/pitches/` | `{date}-{industry}-{persona}.md` |\n| Proposals | `assets/sales/proposals/` | `{date}-{client}-proposal.md` |\n| Case Studies | `assets/sales/case-studies/` | `{date}-{client}-{outcome}.md` |\n| Battlecards | `assets/sales/battlecards/` | `{competitor}.md` |\n| **SEO** | | |\n| SEO Audits | `assets/seo/audits/` | `{date}-{domain}-audit.md` |\n| Keyword Research | `assets/seo/keywords/` | `{date}-{topic}-keywords.md` |\n| Schema Markup | `assets/seo/schemas/` | `{page}-schema.json` |\n| **Funnels** | | |\n| Funnel Designs | `assets/funnels/designs/` | `{date}-{slug}-funnel.md` |\n| Funnel Audits | `assets/funnels/audits/` | `{date}-{funnel}-audit.md` |\n| A/B Tests | `assets/funnels/tests/` | `{date}-{test-name}.md` |\n| **Leads** | | |\n| Scoring Models | `assets/leads/scoring-models/` | `{date}-{model-name}.md` |\n| Segments | `assets/leads/segments/` | `{segment-name}.md` |\n| ICP Profiles | `assets/leads/icp-profiles/` | `{persona}.md` |\n| **Community** | | |\n| Response Templates | `assets/community/templates/` | `{situation}.md` |\n| FAQs | `assets/community/faqs/` | `{topic}.md` |\n| Moderation Guides | `assets/community/moderation/` | `{policy}.md` |\n| **Retention** | | |\n| Retention Campaigns | `assets/retention/campaigns/` | `{date}-{campaign}.md` |\n| Health Scoring | `assets/retention/scoring-models/` | `{date}-{model}.md` |\n| Intervention Playbooks | `assets/retention/playbooks/` | `{segment}.md` |\n| **Attraction** | | |\n| Landing Page Content | `assets/attraction/landing-pages/` | `{slug}.md` |\n| Lead Magnets | `assets/attraction/lead-magnets/` | `{slug}.md` |\n| pSEO Templates | `assets/attraction/pseo-templates/` | `{template-name}.md` |\n| Content Briefs | `assets/attraction/content-briefs/` | `{date}-{topic}.md` |\n| **Diagnostics** | | |\n| Campaign Audits | `assets/diagnostics/campaign-audits/` | `{date}-{campaign}.md` |\n| Content Reviews | `assets/diagnostics/content-reviews/` | `{date}-{content}.md` |\n\n### Naming Conventions\n\nLoad: `references/naming-conventions.md`\n\n### Directory Structure Rules\n\nLoad: `references/directory-structure.md`\n\n### Asset Type Details\n\nLoad: `references/asset-types.md`\n\n## Core Rules\n\n1. **Always use kebab-case** for slugs and filenames\n2. **Date prefix** for time-sensitive assets: `{YYMMDD}` or `{YYMMDD-HHmm}`\n3. **Self-contained folders** for multi-file assets (articles, videos, storyboards)\n4. **Flat files** for single-file assets (transcripts, writing-styles)\n5. **Platform subfolders** for platform-specific content\n\n## Date Format\n\nUse `$CK_PLAN_DATE_FORMAT` env var or default to `YYMMDD-HHmm`.\n\n```bash\n# PowerShell\nGet-Date -UFormat \"%y%m%d-%H%M\"\n\n# Bash\ndate +%y%m%d-%H%M\n```\n\n## Pre-Output Checklist\n\nBefore writing any asset:\n1. Determine asset type → get base path\n2. Generate slug from topic/title\n3. Check if folder/file exists (avoid overwrite)\n4. Create directory structure if needed\n5. Output all related files together\n\n## Integration Points\n\nThis skill integrates with:\n- `/video:create` - Video assets\n- `/video:storyboard:create` - Storyboard assets\n- `/content/blog` - Article assets\n- `/campaign` commands - Campaign assets\n- `content-creator` agent - Various content\n- `ui-ux-designer` agent - Design assets\n- `copywriter` agent - Copy assets\n- `email-wizard` agent - Email copy\n- `social-media-manager` agent - Social posts\n- `campaign-manager` agent - Campaign assets\n- `sale-enabler` agent - Sales assets\n- `seo-specialist` agent - SEO assets\n- `/seo` commands - SEO audits\n- `funnel-architect` agent - Funnel assets\n- `lead-qualifier` agent - Lead assets\n- `community-manager` agent - Community assets\n- `continuity-specialist` agent - Retention assets\n- `attraction-specialist` agent - Attraction assets\n- `campaign-debugger` agent - Diagnostic reports\n- `content-reviewer` agent - Review reports\n- `analytics` skill - Analytics reports\n- `seo-optimization` skill - SEO reports\n- `social-media` skill - Social reports\n- `campaign-management` skill - Campaign reports\n- `ads-management` skill - Ads reports\n- `email-marketing` skill - Email reports\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:03:47.747Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Marketing Agents needing standardized asset management and organization capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要标准化资产管理和组织能力的营销代理。","ja":"マーケティングエージェントが標準化されたアセット管理と組織化の機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"표준화된 자산 관리 및 조직화 기능이 필요한 마케팅 에이전트에게 이상적입니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de marketing que necesitan capacidades de gestión y organización de activos estandarizadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de marketing qui ont besoin de capacités de gestion et d''organisation d''actifs standardisées.","de":"Perfekt für Marketing-Agenten, die standardisierte Vermögensverwaltungs- und Organisationsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Marketing que precisam de capacidades de gerenciamento e organização de ativos padronizados.","ru":"Идеально для маркетинговых агентов, которым необходимы стандартизированные возможности управления и организации активов.","ar":"مثالي لوسائل الإعلام التسويقية التي تحتاج إلى إمكانيات إدارة وتنظيم الأصول الموحدة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to streamline content creation by standardizing asset output locations, naming conventions, and directory structures for marketing outputs, utilizing file formats and protocols like articles, videos, and designs.","zh":"通过标准化资产输出位置、命名约定和目录结构，利用文件格式和协议（如文章、视频和设计）来简化内容创建，赋予代理简化内容创建的能力。","ja":"アセットの出力先、命名規則、ディレクトリ構造を標準化し、ファイル形式やプロトコル（例：記事、動画、デザイン）を利用してコンテンツの作成を効率化することで、エージェントがコンテンツの作成を簡素化できるようにします。","ko":"자산 출력 위치, 명명 규칙 및 디렉토리 구조를 표준화하고, 파일 형식 및 프로토콜(예: 기사, 비디오, 디자인)을 활용하여 콘텐츠 생성을 간소화함으로써 에이전트가 콘텐츠 생성을 간소화할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes simplificar la creación de contenido estandarizando las ubicaciones de salida de activos, las convenciones de nomenclatura y las estructuras de directorios para los resultados de marketing, utilizando formatos de archivo y protocolos como artículos, videos y diseños.","fr":"Permet aux agents de rationaliser la création de contenu en normalisant les emplacements de sortie d''actifs, les conventions de dénomination et les structures de répertoires pour les sorties de marketing, en utilisant des formats de fichiers et des protocoles tels que les articles, les vidéos et les conceptions.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, die Inhaltserschaffung zu rationalisieren, indem sie die Ausgabestellen von Vermögenswerten, die Benennungskonventionen und die Verzeichnisstrukturen für Marketingausgaben standardisieren, wobei Dateiformate und Protokolle wie Artikel, Videos und Designs verwendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a racionalizar a criação de conteúdo, padronizando locais de saída de ativos, convenções de nomenclatura e estruturas de diretório para saídas de marketing, utilizando formatos de arquivo e protocolos como artigos, vídeos e designs.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оптимизировать создание контента, стандартизируя места вывода активов, соглашения об именах и структуры каталогов для маркетинговых выводов, используя форматы файлов и протоколы, такие как статьи, видео и дизайны.","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من تسهيل إنشاء المحتوى من خلال توحيد مواقع إخراج الأصول وتوافق تسمية البنية التحتية لخروجات التسويق، باستخدام صيغ الملفات والبروتوكولات مثل المقالات والفيديوهات والتصاميم."},"useCases":{"en":["Standardizing asset naming conventions for new marketing campaigns","Organizing existing asset directories for easier content generation","Determining optimal output paths for AI-generated assets like images and storyboards"],"zh":["为新营销活动标准化资产命名约定","组织现有的资产目录以便于内容生成","确定AI生成资产（如图像和故事板）最优输出路径"],"ja":["新しいマーケティングキャンペーンのアセット命名規則を標準化する","既存のアセットディレクトリを整理してコンテンツ生成を容易にする","AI生成アセット（例：画像、ストーリーボード）最適な出力パスを決定する"],"ko":["새로운 마케팅 캠페인의 자산 명명 규칙을 표준화하는 것","既存의 자산 디렉토리를 조직하여 콘텐츠 생성을 용이하게 하는 것","AI 생성 자산(예: 이미지, 스토리보드) 최적의 출력 경로를 결정하는 것"],"es":["Estandarizar las convenciones de nomenclatura de activos para nuevas campañas de marketing","Organizar los directorios de activos existentes para una generación de contenido más fácil","Determinar las rutas de salida óptimas para activos generados por IA como imágenes y storyboards"],"fr":["Normaliser les conventions de dénomination d''actifs pour les nouvelles campagnes de marketing","Organiser les répertoires d''actifs existants pour une génération de contenu plus facile","Déterminer les chemins de sortie optimaux pour les actifs générés par l''IA comme les images et les storyboards"],"de":["Die Benennungskonventionen von Vermögenswerten für neue Marketingkampagnen standardisieren","Die bestehenden Vermögensverzeichnisse für eine einfachere Inhaltsgenerierung organisieren","Die optimalen Ausgabewege für von KI generierte Vermögenswerte wie Bilder und Storyboards bestimmen"],"pt":["Padronizar convenções de nomenclatura de ativos para novas campanhas de marketing","Organizar diretórios de ativos existentes para facilitar a geração de conteúdo","Determinar caminhos de saída ótimos para ativos gerados por IA, como imagens e storyboards"],"ru":["Стандартизировать соглашения об именах активов для новых маркетинговых кампаний","Организовать существующие каталоги активов для более легкой генерации контента","Определить оптимальные пути вывода для активов, сгенерированных ИИ, таких как изображения и сториборды"],"ar":["توحيد اتفاقيات تسمية الأصول للمحملات التسويقية الجديدة","تنظيم دليل الأصول الحالية لتسهيل إنتاج المحتوى","تحديد مسارات إخراج مثالية للأصول التي تم إنشاؤها بواسطة الذكاء الاصطناعي، مثل الصور والقصص المصورة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires predefined asset types and output paths","Limited to marketing output assets","Needs consistent directory structure for optimal performance"],"zh":["需要预定义的资产类型和输出路径","仅限于营销输出资产","需要一致的目录结构以获得最佳性能"],"ja":["事前に定義されたアセットタイプと出力パスが必要","マーケティング出力アセットのみに限定","最適なパフォーマンスを得るために一貫したディレクトリ構造が必要"],"ko":["사전에 정의된 자산 유형 및 출력 경로가 필요","마케팅 출력 자산에만 제한","최적의 성능을 얻기 위해 일관된 디렉토리 구조가 필요"],"es":["Requiere tipos de activos predefinidos y rutas de salida","Limitado a activos de salida de marketing","Necesita una estructura de directorio coherente para un rendimiento óptimo"],"fr":["Nécessite des types d''actifs prédéfinis et des chemins de sortie","Limité aux actifs de sortie de marketing","Nécessite une structure de répertoire cohérente pour des performances optimales"],"de":["Benötigt vordefinierte Vermögenstypen und Ausgabewege","Begrenzt auf Marketing-Ausgabevermögen","Benötigt eine konsistente Verzeichnisstruktur für optimale Leistung"],"pt":["Exige tipos de ativos predefinidos e caminhos de saída","Limitado a ativos de saída de marketing","Necessita de estrutura de diretório consistente para desempenho ótimo"],"ru":["Требует предварительно определенных типов активов и путей вывода","Ограничен активами маркетингового вывода","Требует последовательной структуры каталога для оптимальной производительности"],"ar":["يتطلب أنواع أصول محددة مسبقًا ومسارات إخراج","محدود بأصول إخراج التسويق","يحتاج إلى هيكل دليل متسق لأداء مثالي"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"10cb6439c93d87bd88639c5d3aa2f46244be2bed6009b438368f744b8b9316d8","qualityScore":57}');
