INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('NammDev/Goads-Krea/assets-organizing', 'assets-organizing', 'NammDev', 'Goads-Krea', 'community', 'assets-organizing NammDev Goads-Krea community The assets-organizing skill standardizes asset output locations, naming conventions, and directory structures for marketing outputs, benefiting developers and content creators. It simplifies content organization and generation. AI资产组织工具用于标准化资产输出的路径、命名约定和目录结构，适用于创建内容、生成AI资产和组织现有资产 AIエージェントによるアセット整理は、アセットの出力パス、命名規則、ディレクトリ構造を標準化するために使用され、コンテンツの作成、AIアセットの生成、既存アセットの整理に適しています AI 에이전트를 활용한 자산 구성은 자산의 출력 경로, 이름 지정 규칙 및 디렉토리 구조를 표준화하는 데 사용되며, 콘텐츠 생성, AI 자산 생성 및 기존 자산 구성에 적합합니다 El skill de organización de activos permite standardizar la salida de activos de marketing. Establece rutas de salida, convenciones de nomenclatura y estructuras de directorios para artículos, videos, diseños y más. Le skill d''organisation d''actifs permet de standardiser la sortie d''actifs de marketing. Il établit des chemins de sortie, des conventions de nommage et des structures de répertoires pour les articles, les vidéos, les conceptions et plus encore. Das Skill zur Organisation von Assets ermöglicht die Standardisierung der Ausgabe von Marketing-Assets. Es legt Ausgabepfade, Namenskonventionen und Verzeichnisstrukturen für Artikel, Videos, Designs und mehr fest. Organize ativos de marketing com padrões de saída e nomeação para Ferramentas de IA. Padronize a estrutura de diretório para conteúdo de marketing. Организуйте маркетинговые активы с помощью стандартов вывода и именования для ИИ Агентов. Стандартизируйте структуру директорий для маркетингового контента. رتب الأصول التسويقية باستخدام معايير الإخراج والتسمية للآلات التعلم الإصطناعي. ضبط هيكل الدلائل للمحتوى التسويقي. how to use assets-organizing what is assets-organizing assets-organizing setup guide assets-organizing alternative assets-organizing vs manual organization standardized asset management asset naming conventions directory structure best practices AI资产组织工具 资产输出路径标准化 命名约定管理 目录结构组织 创建内容 生成AI资产 组织现有资产 标准化输出路径 Standardizes asset output locations using directory structures like `assets/articles/` Determines output paths for new content types, such as videos and designs Generates consistent naming conventions for assets, including articles and images Organizes existing assets using standardized directory structures Supports AI asset generation, including images, storyboards, and scripts assets-organizing is a skill that standardizes asset management by determining output paths and naming conventions for various asset types, including articles, images, and videos.');
